(688543, 72593, 18512, '<td valign="top">Idea is fine, lighting and colours as well. But the composition could have been better, for instance if you brought the baskets a little out from the center.</td>', 'Idea is fine, lighting and colours as well. But the composition could have been better, for instance if you brought the baskets a little out from the center.', '2004-04-28 03:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
