(688590, 72394, 20064, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but the shot it self is not very interesting. If I didnt know what these were, I would think the picture is overly simple. I would have tried to portray the fact that each doll fits into another one, and that there are several in there.</td>', 'I like the idea, but the shot it self is not very interesting. If I didnt know what these were, I would think the picture is overly simple. I would have tried to portray the fact that each doll fits into another one, and that there are several in there.', '2004-04-28 05:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
