(688597, 72509, 20064, '<td valign="top">I think the title "Big Mom" would have been nice also, the idea is clear, but I am a little distracted by the um.. hair on the face, a close shave and some foundation would have made this a better eye pleaser.</td>', 'I think the title "Big Mom" would have been nice also, the idea is clear, but I am a little distracted by the um.. hair on the face, a close shave and some foundation would have made this a better eye pleaser.', '2004-04-28 06:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
