(688697, 72098, 9295, '<td valign="top">Good illustration of the theme, but the picture itself is somewhat lacking. I don''t care for the car even though you may have intended it to be a third element to the different proportions, but the tree and the person would have been enough. I like the panoramic but there''s something about the colors that just doesn''t "wow" me. All in all, it''s a pretty nice shot, just not terribly interesting outside the challenge.</td>', 'Good illustration of the theme, but the picture itself is somewhat lacking. I don''t care for the car even though you may have intended it to be a third element to the different proportions, but the tree and the person would have been enough. I like the panoramic but there''s something about the colors that just doesn''t "wow" me. All in all, it''s a pretty nice shot, just not terribly interesting outside the challenge.', '2004-04-28 09:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
