(688713, 72516, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is a great illustration of the challenge theme!  I like just about everything about it. It would have been nice if the worker were a little brighter--he gets a tad lost in the color of the billboard, but other than that, I think it''s a great shot.</td>', 'This is a great illustration of the challenge theme!  I like just about everything about it. It would have been nice if the worker were a little brighter--he gets a tad lost in the color of the billboard, but other than that, I think it''s a great shot.', '2004-04-28 09:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(688715, 72047, 19446, '<td valign="top">Excellent depiction of proportion.  I have to only give it a 5 though, because the sky is so washed-out.  It''s a tricky shot with such a variation in darks and lights.</td>', 'Excellent depiction of proportion.  I have to only give it a 5 though, because the sky is so washed-out.  It''s a tricky shot with such a variation in darks and lights.', '2004-04-28 09:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
