(688717, 72516, 7543, '<td valign="top">Good eye, this shot could be in one of the larger newspapers or newsweek or something. Probably will not score very high here (like the grade stuff at DPC), but it''s very good.</td>', 'Good eye, this shot could be in one of the larger newspapers or newsweek or something. Probably will not score very high here (like the grade stuff at DPC), but it''s very good.', '2004-04-28 09:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(688719, 72662, 14255, '<td valign="top">I love the background</td>', 'I love the background', '2004-04-28 09:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(688720, 72815, 9295, '<td valign="top">Your photo matches the theme, but it lacks interest.  The lighting in the background is too bright and washes out the detail of the paneling and the spacing of the objects doesn''t feel right.  This seems more or less a simple snapshot of two household items than an artistic interpretation of the challenge.</td>', 'Your photo matches the theme, but it lacks interest.  The lighting in the background is too bright and washes out the detail of the paneling and the spacing of the objects doesn''t feel right.  This seems more or less a simple snapshot of two household items than an artistic interpretation of the challenge.', '2004-04-28 09:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
