(688724, 72560, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is a very dark snapshot that even in a family album would lack appeal. The mother''s face is completely blacked out by her hair and the dark clothing makes her lost against the dark wall and circle of the window in the door. The best part of the shot is the little kid''s pose and the pacifier. The blue colors he''s wearing sets him apart from the rest.</td>', 'This is a very dark snapshot that even in a family album would lack appeal. The mother''s face is completely blacked out by her hair and the dark clothing makes her lost against the dark wall and circle of the window in the door. The best part of the shot is the little kid''s pose and the pacifier. The blue colors he''s wearing sets him apart from the rest.', '2004-04-28 09:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(688725, 72012, 15919, '<td valign="top">Dont get the idea but the image is ok.  Think you could use a litle more colorsaturation and maybe it´s a litle underexposed.  Also it isn´t very sharp and well focused, at least asuming that you aren´t using very shallow DOF.</td>', 'Dont get the idea but the image is ok.  Think you could use a litle more colorsaturation and maybe it´s a litle underexposed.  Also it isn´t very sharp and well focused, at least asuming that you aren´t using very shallow DOF.', '2004-04-28 09:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
