(688763, 71642, 16488, '<td valign="top">Simple and effective.</td>', 'Simple and effective.', '2004-04-28 09:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(688765, 72389, 15919, '<td valign="top">The head of the dog and the dog and the front feets and the dead mouse is in a shadow while the back part is not.  Think that makes it very hard to shoot a good image.  Would have been better the otherway around.  Dont get the idea unless it´s the sunny/shadowy porportions.</td>', 'The head of the dog and the dog and the front feets and the dead mouse is in a shadow while the back part is not.  Think that makes it very hard to shoot a good image.  Would have been better the otherway around.  Dont get the idea unless it´s the sunny/shadowy porportions.', '2004-04-28 09:59:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(688766, 71975, 15919, '<td valign="top">Not sure I get the idea and the relation to the challenge but the image is good.  Nice effect and creatively performed.</td>', 'Not sure I get the idea and the relation to the challenge but the image is good.  Nice effect and creatively performed.', '2004-04-28 10:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(688767, 72535, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I like the idea that the mirrored world can be in perfect proportion to the "real" one.  By setting the division of these two at the mid-point of the photo you emphasize this equivalency.  Sharp colors, nicely lit and composed.  The smaller format makes it hard to really appreciate the details, though.</td>', 'Nice.  I like the idea that the mirrored world can be in perfect proportion to the "real" one.  By setting the division of these two at the mid-point of the photo you emphasize this equivalency.  Sharp colors, nicely lit and composed.  The smaller format makes it hard to really appreciate the details, though.', '2004-04-28 10:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(688768, 72651, 15919, '<td valign="top">Nice framing.  Maybe you should have given it a tighter corping.  Good image but I´m not sure I´m getting the idea.</td>', 'Nice framing.  Maybe you should have given it a tighter corping.  Good image but I´m not sure I´m getting the idea.', '2004-04-28 10:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(688770, 72326, 15919, '<td valign="top">Seems to be at least 2 big boys there.  The image seems a litle overexposed and shoft focused and I´m not sure I´m getting the idea.</td>', 'Seems to be at least 2 big boys there.  The image seems a litle overexposed and shoft focused and I´m not sure I´m getting the idea.', '2004-04-28 10:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(688773, 72659, 16488, '<td valign="top">Lovely, rich color.  Beautiful detail on the droplets.  Nice texture.  Good use of negative space.  The only disappointment is the foreground leaf because it''s in the center and out of focus, and because it hides some of those wonderful water drops.</td>', 'Lovely, rich color.  Beautiful detail on the droplets.  Nice texture.  Good use of negative space.  The only disappointment is the foreground leaf because it''s in the center and out of focus, and because it hides some of those wonderful water drops.', '2004-04-28 10:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(688774, 72725, 16488, '<td valign="top">There is limited detail in the red tulips.  Perhaps a shallower depth of field and focus more on the flowers, less on the pine tree and grass.  The idea of the pink to red ratio is interesting but technically I don''t think you pulled it off.</td>', 'There is limited detail in the red tulips.  Perhaps a shallower depth of field and focus more on the flowers, less on the pine tree and grass.  The idea of the pink to red ratio is interesting but technically I don''t think you pulled it off.', '2004-04-28 10:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(688779, 71729, 18856, '<td valign="top">very hippie...</td>', 'very hippie...', '2004-04-28 10:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(688786, 72811, 19841, '<td valign="top">I wish this was in color.  Food in b&amp;w just isn''t as appealing.</td>', 'I wish this was in color.  Food in b&w just isn''t as appealing.', '2004-04-28 10:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(688789, 72563, 19446, '<td valign="top">Excellent job!  9</td>', 'Excellent job!  9', '2004-04-28 10:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(688790, 72516, 19841, '<td valign="top">Woah... the extreme zoom on this makes it Escheresque.  Delightfully disturbing.</td>', 'Woah... the extreme zoom on this makes it Escheresque.  Delightfully disturbing.', '2004-04-28 10:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(688791, 72365, 16488, '<td valign="top">Perhaps if the tree wasn''t in the way, I could buy the title.  The second kite detracts as well.  I wonder if this reflects use of proportion or is really a use of perspective.  Cute idea--worth another try.</td>', 'Perhaps if the tree wasn''t in the way, I could buy the title.  The second kite detracts as well.  I wonder if this reflects use of proportion or is really a use of perspective.  Cute idea--worth another try.', '2004-04-28 10:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(688794, 72153, 1368, '<td valign="top">Sky is amazing! Great picture</td>', 'Sky is amazing! Great picture', '2004-04-28 10:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(688796, 72779, 20135, '<td valign="top">A classic! Very funny, yet shows the inquisitive nature of children perfectly.</td>', 'A classic! Very funny, yet shows the inquisitive nature of children perfectly.', '2004-04-28 10:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
