(688936, 72742, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting idea in regards to the challenge. What in the world is this place? I''m distracted by that red car in front of Gerald Ford but otherwise it looks pretty good. Is it about to hit him? :D</td>', 'This is an interesting idea in regards to the challenge. What in the world is this place? I''m distracted by that red car in front of Gerald Ford but otherwise it looks pretty good. Is it about to hit him? :D', '2004-04-28 11:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(688938, 72600, 3185, '<td valign="top">I loved the abstract nature of this photo. I was unsure at first what I was looking at at first and every time I come back to it, it plays tricks on my eyes. One of my favs...</td>', 'I loved the abstract nature of this photo. I was unsure at first what I was looking at at first and every time I come back to it, it plays tricks on my eyes. One of my favs...', '2004-04-28 11:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(688939, 72560, 7322, '<td valign="top">Sorry but this is just a nice snapshot.There are too many distractions and the image is very washed out and lacking in detail. The distractions: a box on the floor behind the boy,  a tuft of fur (the dog?) peeping out from the botttom edge, and most of all the edge of that white door and its stained glass panel. Another problem is you can''t see mom''s face. Even though it meets the criteria in terms of subject matter, I have to vote low on this one.</td>', 'Sorry but this is just a nice snapshot.There are too many distractions and the image is very washed out and lacking in detail. The distractions: a box on the floor behind the boy,  a tuft of fur (the dog?) peeping out from the botttom edge, and most of all the edge of that white door and its stained glass panel. Another problem is you can''t see mom''s face. Even though it meets the criteria in terms of subject matter, I have to vote low on this one.', '2004-04-28 11:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(688944, 72341, 3185, '<td valign="top">Very creepy. I would have never thought to do this but now that I think about it, I do remember a very similar pic I have of my daughter that created a similar surreal look. I think this pic fits very well to the challenge and was executed nicely!</td>', 'Very creepy. I would have never thought to do this but now that I think about it, I do remember a very similar pic I have of my daughter that created a similar surreal look. I think this pic fits very well to the challenge and was executed nicely!', '2004-04-28 11:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(688946, 71630, 5391, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see this a bit more off-center, and have a touch more contrast to give it "oomph".  Nice subject.</td>', 'I''d like to see this a bit more off-center, and have a touch more contrast to give it "oomph".  Nice subject.', '2004-04-28 11:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
