(689000, 72742, 15919, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty comic setup.  Fine image but maybe you should have used a smaller apperture if you could or else either focus on GB or the phone and blurr the rest.  It´s a shame about this red car, bottom right.  Find it hard to find the conection to the challenge subject but this is a fine image.</td>', 'This is a pretty comic setup.  Fine image but maybe you should have used a smaller apperture if you could or else either focus on GB or the phone and blurr the rest.  It´s a shame about this red car, bottom right.  Find it hard to find the conection to the challenge subject but this is a fine image.', '2004-04-28 12:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
