(689003, 71973, 20135, '<td valign="top">The reverse panorama works really well with an overly long shadow. I would say though that the image looks slightly out of focus in places and there are some jaggedy lines in top right of corner which distract.</td>', 'The reverse panorama works really well with an overly long shadow. I would say though that the image looks slightly out of focus in places and there are some jaggedy lines in top right of corner which distract.', '2004-04-28 12:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
