(689074, 72667, 5391, '<td valign="top">Very clever composition.  This could be used for a textbook example of how to position objects within the frame.  It''s composed in a nice dynamic line, and the eye is actually led from front to back, as if looking into a 3-D scene.  (The little triangle up in the right corner is a distraction, but other than that, it''s perfect.)  Great colors, contrasts and human interest.</td>', 'Very clever composition.  This could be used for a textbook example of how to position objects within the frame.  It''s composed in a nice dynamic line, and the eye is actually led from front to back, as if looking into a 3-D scene.  (The little triangle up in the right corner is a distraction, but other than that, it''s perfect.)  Great colors, contrasts and human interest.', '2004-04-28 13:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
