(689132, 72739, 18868, '<td valign="top">The artifacts from the Hue/Saturation mods are really unpleasant.  The function "selective color" under selection offers a "softness'' control, but unfortunately, it''s against the rules to use it.  All things considered, the shot would have worked better if you used a worklamp to shine through the flag (creating a stronger effect on the actual image) rather than trying to bring it up in photoshop.</td>', 'The artifacts from the Hue/Saturation mods are really unpleasant.  The function "selective color" under selection offers a "softness'' control, but unfortunately, it''s against the rules to use it.  All things considered, the shot would have worked better if you used a worklamp to shine through the flag (creating a stronger effect on the actual image) rather than trying to bring it up in photoshop.', '2004-04-28 13:54:20.000000', NULL, 1),
