(689264, 72647, 13547, '<td valign="top">i like this, although i''m not sure it shows proportion in the true sense of the word.  I love the colours &amp; shadows.  Perhaps it would be a little better if you had got more above the handle to get the keyhole closer and so remove the space between the handle and the hole, which tends to draw my eye a bit too much IMHO.  Otherwise a nice shot!</td>', 'i like this, although i''m not sure it shows proportion in the true sense of the word.  I love the colours & shadows.  Perhaps it would be a little better if you had got more above the handle to get the keyhole closer and so remove the space between the handle and the hole, which tends to draw my eye a bit too much IMHO.  Otherwise a nice shot!', '2004-04-28 15:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(689265, 72444, 9643, '<td valign="top">I feel uncertain about how this fits the challenge but I love the picture!</td>', 'I feel uncertain about how this fits the challenge but I love the picture!', '2004-04-28 15:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(689271, 71712, 13547, '<td valign="top">Your camera''s focused on something in front of the buildings, probably wires of some kind, so it isn''t as crisp as it could be.  I''m sure you could get them upright, and it would be better to have something small in the foreground to show the proportion.</td>', 'Your camera''s focused on something in front of the buildings, probably wires of some kind, so it isn''t as crisp as it could be.  I''m sure you could get them upright, and it would be better to have something small in the foreground to show the proportion.', '2004-04-28 15:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(689272, 72090, 13547, '<td valign="top">A wonderfully crisp shot!  Colours are great, but the background is perhaos a bit dark.  Not sure there was much you could do there tho.</td>', 'A wonderfully crisp shot!  Colours are great, but the background is perhaos a bit dark.  Not sure there was much you could do there tho.', '2004-04-28 15:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
