(689374, 72667, 327, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and great compostion here. Like it. :D</td>', 'Beautiful colors and great compostion here. Like it. :D', '2004-04-28 16:45:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(689375, 72798, 14053, '<td valign="top">very good expression of the subject</td>', 'very good expression of the subject', '2004-04-28 16:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(689382, 72598, 19116, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture.  it would be nice if at least the bottom of the mountain was clearer throught the mist.  maybe less saturation would do it.</td>', 'Beautiful picture.  it would be nice if at least the bottom of the mountain was clearer throught the mist.  maybe less saturation would do it.', '2004-04-28 16:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(689387, 71974, 19116, '<td valign="top">Nice macro shot.  Is it possible to get both in focus?</td>', 'Nice macro shot.  Is it possible to get both in focus?', '2004-04-28 16:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(689398, 72444, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the forced perspective on this and the cat''s expression as well. The white in the foreground make dominate a little too much but otherwise a delightful well composed photo.</td>', 'I like the forced perspective on this and the cat''s expression as well. The white in the foreground make dominate a little too much but otherwise a delightful well composed photo.', '2004-04-28 16:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(689404, 71944, 20774, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful these foto! congratulations! the colors are wonderful. Love it</td>', 'Very beautiful these foto! congratulations! the colors are wonderful. Love it', '2004-04-28 16:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(689409, 72653, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like this very much. I like the repetition of the curvature of the beetle and the eggshell. The photo could be a little sharper but I like the contrast of colors. I''m curious to know if a wider shot with more of the egg showing would be more successful compositionally.</td>', 'I like this very much. I like the repetition of the curvature of the beetle and the eggshell. The photo could be a little sharper but I like the contrast of colors. I''m curious to know if a wider shot with more of the egg showing would be more successful compositionally.', '2004-04-28 16:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(689414, 72465, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image. It definitely meets the criteria. I wonder if you could have moved in close enough to crop out that strip of soil and still made the statement? Perhaps framing it horizontally would have allowed you to keep the expanse of sky yet omit the distracting strip?</td>', 'This is a nice image. It definitely meets the criteria. I wonder if you could have moved in close enough to crop out that strip of soil and still made the statement? Perhaps framing it horizontally would have allowed you to keep the expanse of sky yet omit the distracting strip?', '2004-04-28 17:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(689417, 71658, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a very striking abstract image and it meets the criteria. I would prefer more contrast between the shadows and the benches.</td>', 'This is a very striking abstract image and it meets the criteria. I would prefer more contrast between the shadows and the benches.', '2004-04-28 17:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(689420, 72488, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting idea but I''m not floored by this arrangement. I think it might have been more effective if you had just used the spoons and made a more interesting use of negative space. As it is, the negative space in this composition is static and boring.</td>', 'This is an interesting idea but I''m not floored by this arrangement. I think it might have been more effective if you had just used the spoons and made a more interesting use of negative space. As it is, the negative space in this composition is static and boring.', '2004-04-28 17:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(689422, 72465, 16488, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and a nice idea for the challenge.  I think it would look a little more lonely cropped from the bottom and the left a bit more.  Gorgeous color--simply composed--effective.</td>', 'Beautiful and a nice idea for the challenge.  I think it would look a little more lonely cropped from the bottom and the left a bit more.  Gorgeous color--simply composed--effective.', '2004-04-28 17:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(689426, 72788, 7322, '<td valign="top">Without the title I don''t think I would have caught on that both these images were of yourself. As a photo it has potential although I don''t think you quite caught it here. There is a line of shadow running vertically down the face of you in the tie and you in the sweater are far too fuzzy and unfocused. To make a more obvious point about proportion you should have made sure your shirt and tie were much neater. At any rate, I think this is stretching the idea of proportion a bit. Sure there is contrast between a working stiff and a casual guy in a sweater but I don''t think that really illustrates proportion or lack of proportion.</td>', 'Without the title I don''t think I would have caught on that both these images were of yourself. As a photo it has potential although I don''t think you quite caught it here. There is a line of shadow running vertically down the face of you in the tie and you in the sweater are far too fuzzy and unfocused. To make a more obvious point about proportion you should have made sure your shirt and tie were much neater. At any rate, I think this is stretching the idea of proportion a bit. Sure there is contrast between a working stiff and a casual guy in a sweater but I don''t think that really illustrates proportion or lack of proportion.', '2004-04-28 17:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(689428, 72773, 327, '<td valign="top">!!really nice dof and light. Lovely, great poster.</td>', '!!really nice dof and light. Lovely, great poster.', '2004-04-28 17:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(689430, 72652, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty good example but the horizon is tilted down on the right....</td>', 'Pretty good example but the horizon is tilted down on the right....', '2004-04-28 17:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(689431, 72444, 327, '<td valign="top">lol.....one huge cat!! Like this, good focus, light.</td>', 'lol.....one huge cat!! Like this, good focus, light.', '2004-04-28 17:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(689434, 72228, 7322, '<td valign="top">This would have been a far more striking abstract without the black grate in the top left corner. I don''t really see how that adds to the idea of proportion or lack of it unless you want to argue that the distracting grate adds a lack of proportion to the image. The problem there is, it does so in an unpleasing way and uninteresting way. I think focusing more  tightly on fewer bricks and shooting straight ahead instead of slightly up would have made a more powerful statement about the proportion in the design of these colorful bricks. The slight tilt upward is skewing the design.</td>', 'This would have been a far more striking abstract without the black grate in the top left corner. I don''t really see how that adds to the idea of proportion or lack of it unless you want to argue that the distracting grate adds a lack of proportion to the image. The problem there is, it does so in an unpleasing way and uninteresting way. I think focusing more  tightly on fewer bricks and shooting straight ahead instead of slightly up would have made a more powerful statement about the proportion in the design of these colorful bricks. The slight tilt upward is skewing the design.', '2004-04-28 17:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(689450, 72418, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a really small monster truck? I don''t get this at all? This is a very poorly planned composition with too many distracting details to make a powerful statement. If this is a small monster truck than it might have been effective to pose someone standing next to it in order to make an obvious statement. You should also have isolated the truck against a totally neutral background. It is somewhat out of focus which is evident in the slight blurring of the letters on the door of the truck. <br/> <br/>Here is a very important tip which will go a long way toward improving your photos. <br/>A photographer has to remember that the camera records *everything* within the frame of its viewfinder. The human brain works in conjection with the eyes to filter out distracting and unpleasing details. The camera is incapable of doing this. When the photographer fails to pay careful attention to any distracting details the result is shots like this.</td>', 'This is a really small monster truck? I don''t get this at all? This is a very poorly planned composition with too many distracting details to make a powerful statement. If this is a small monster truck than it might have been effective to pose someone standing next to it in order to make an obvious statement. You should also have isolated the truck against a totally neutral background. It is somewhat out of focus which is evident in the slight blurring of the letters on the door of the truck.  Here is a very important tip which will go a long way toward improving your photos. A photographer has to remember that the camera records *everything* within the frame of its viewfinder. The human brain works in conjection with the eyes to filter out distracting and unpleasing details. The camera is incapable of doing this. When the photographer fails to pay careful attention to any distracting details the result is shots like this.', '2004-04-28 17:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(689452, 72753, 20481, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, congratulations</td>', 'Nice shot, congratulations', '2004-04-28 17:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(689453, 72444, 16488, '<td valign="top">Actually, the way you''ve cropped this it looks more like a small (though chubby) cat in a big sink--which is really very funny!  Love the expression on the cat!  The whole arrangement really conveys the cat''s sense of proportion concerning the threat of the tap being turned on.  Unfortunate red reflection on the chrome.  Otherwise, nearly perfect.  Hope the cat haters don''t bring you down.  Luck!</td>', 'Actually, the way you''ve cropped this it looks more like a small (though chubby) cat in a big sink--which is really very funny!  Love the expression on the cat!  The whole arrangement really conveys the cat''s sense of proportion concerning the threat of the tap being turned on.  Unfortunate red reflection on the chrome.  Otherwise, nearly perfect.  Hope the cat haters don''t bring you down.  Luck!', '2004-04-28 17:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(689456, 72515, 20481, '<td valign="top">Excellent light/shadows manage</td>', 'Excellent light/shadows manage', '2004-04-28 17:24:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(689459, 72448, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like this. I like how the flattened, abstract quality of the chairs in front of the strong horizontal lines of the clapboard. It also meets the criteria for proportion.</td>', 'I like this. I like how the flattened, abstract quality of the chairs in front of the strong horizontal lines of the clapboard. It also meets the criteria for proportion.', '2004-04-28 17:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(689463, 71712, 20481, '<td valign="top">A bit blury, must be the glass</td>', 'A bit blury, must be the glass', '2004-04-28 17:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(689465, 72778, 20481, '<td valign="top">a bit dark</td>', 'a bit dark', '2004-04-28 17:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(689467, 72464, 7322, '<td valign="top">You could have spent a bit more time composing this photograph. The statement seems to be about the rock and the Buddah (I''m not sure what that statement is) so why take up so much of the frame with that expanse of distracting brick in the foreground. The blurred stems of grass isn''t adding anything either.  The darkness of the folliage does make a nice contrast with the Buddah but it would have been more striking if you had come in much tighter, placed the Buddah more to the left,  and eliminated all that wasted space in the foreground and on either side of the arrangement.<br/>Without the title it would have taken me a moment to notice the rock sitting there. It just looks kind of random and I don''t get the point you are making.</td>', 'You could have spent a bit more time composing this photograph. The statement seems to be about the rock and the Buddah (I''m not sure what that statement is) so why take up so much of the frame with that expanse of distracting brick in the foreground. The blurred stems of grass isn''t adding anything either.  The darkness of the folliage does make a nice contrast with the Buddah but it would have been more striking if you had come in much tighter, placed the Buddah more to the left,  and eliminated all that wasted space in the foreground and on either side of the arrangement.Without the title it would have taken me a moment to notice the rock sitting there. It just looks kind of random and I don''t get the point you are making.', '2004-04-28 17:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(689468, 72508, 14603, '<td valign="top">Good thinking...one of the best images so far...</td>', 'Good thinking...one of the best images so far...', '2004-04-28 17:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(689470, 72579, 14614, '<td valign="top">you''ve got the idea for the challenge here -- would like to see a deeper dof</td>', 'you''ve got the idea for the challenge here -- would like to see a deeper dof', '2004-04-28 17:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(689472, 72539, 14614, '<td valign="top">I like you''re use of light (or could it just be I''m hungry??)  :)</td>', 'I like you''re use of light (or could it just be I''m hungry??)  :)', '2004-04-28 17:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(689473, 72784, 7322, '<td valign="top">It illustrates proportion but this image doesn''t hold my interest. There''s too much going on with the colorful windows, the shadows at the bottom, and whatever those girder things are on the roof. I do kind of like the way they look against the blue sky but that leaves 2/3 of the frame filled with nothing much.</td>', 'It illustrates proportion but this image doesn''t hold my interest. There''s too much going on with the colorful windows, the shadows at the bottom, and whatever those girder things are on the roof. I do kind of like the way they look against the blue sky but that leaves 2/3 of the frame filled with nothing much.', '2004-04-28 17:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(689475, 72395, 14614, '<td valign="top">quite a cast of characters ;)<br/> <br/>This is an engaging scene made up of many stories.  Theme: can''t see what connection you found (feel free to pm me so I can see where you''ve made the connection)  Composition:  many subjects in the shot - with the title you have me focus on the two "Mice" -- more cropping would have helped eliminate the house and children at the far left.</td>', 'quite a cast of characters ;) This is an engaging scene made up of many stories.  Theme: can''t see what connection you found (feel free to pm me so I can see where you''ve made the connection)  Composition:  many subjects in the shot - with the title you have me focus on the two "Mice" -- more cropping would have helped eliminate the house and children at the far left.', '2004-04-28 17:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(689477, 72578, 7322, '<td valign="top">It illustrates proportion but I don''t really like the shot. Perhaps if you had moved around to the other side, placing the sun over your shoulder instead of behind the tree?  There is that large expanse of overexposed sky that just detracts too much from the subject. A vertical composition probably would have worked much better. You could have cut out all the distractions to the right and left and the vertical image plane would have naturally led the eye upward. My eye keeps wandering off to that other tree and to that hot spot instead of focusing on the central tree.</td>', 'It illustrates proportion but I don''t really like the shot. Perhaps if you had moved around to the other side, placing the sun over your shoulder instead of behind the tree?  There is that large expanse of overexposed sky that just detracts too much from the subject. A vertical composition probably would have worked much better. You could have cut out all the distractions to the right and left and the vertical image plane would have naturally led the eye upward. My eye keeps wandering off to that other tree and to that hot spot instead of focusing on the central tree.', '2004-04-28 17:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(689479, 72326, 14614, '<td valign="top">more cropping on the left would have helped here - other photographer and cup are distracting.</td>', 'more cropping on the left would have helped here - other photographer and cup are distracting.', '2004-04-28 17:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(689480, 72067, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like this. I would like it more if you could have cropped it to exclude that foremost bulb.</td>', 'I like this. I would like it more if you could have cropped it to exclude that foremost bulb.', '2004-04-28 17:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(689481, 72748, 14603, '<td valign="top">Well thought out and well captured</td>', 'Well thought out and well captured', '2004-04-28 17:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(689482, 72105, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice use of proportion to create importance for a small subject.  The distant clump of grass adds context and emphasizes the solitary nature of the subject.   Beautiful color, shadow, texture.... Luck!</td>', 'Nice use of proportion to create importance for a small subject.  The distant clump of grass adds context and emphasizes the solitary nature of the subject.   Beautiful color, shadow, texture.... Luck!', '2004-04-28 17:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
