(689485, 71485, 16488, '<td valign="top">Sweet!  Lovely texture and lighting!  Nice isolation of subject leaf.  Good use of negative space.  Luck!</td>', 'Sweet!  Lovely texture and lighting!  Nice isolation of subject leaf.  Good use of negative space.  Luck!', '2004-04-28 17:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(689486, 72538, 19116, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  nice choice of spices for color.  Not sure about the pink measuring spoons though.</td>', 'Good idea.  nice choice of spices for color.  Not sure about the pink measuring spoons though.', '2004-04-28 17:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(689487, 72402, 14614, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones and composition.</td>', 'Lovely tones and composition.', '2004-04-28 17:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(689488, 72646, 16488, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of proportion to place the subjects.  Would be nice if the people and camel had a crisper focus--perhaps this is a remant of the distance to lens?  Color is unbelievable!  Very poster-like.  Luck!</td>', 'Beautiful use of proportion to place the subjects.  Would be nice if the people and camel had a crisper focus--perhaps this is a remant of the distance to lens?  Color is unbelievable!  Very poster-like.  Luck!', '2004-04-28 17:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(689492, 72739, 14614, '<td valign="top">cropping on the larger bottle is a bit tight on the bottom; flag in the background adds color</td>', 'cropping on the larger bottle is a bit tight on the bottom; flag in the background adds color', '2004-04-28 17:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(689494, 72228, 6845, '<td valign="top">Great color and composition. The vent(or whatever it is) really stands out and pulls your eye to the difference even though the rest of the image is so busy.</td>', 'Great color and composition. The vent(or whatever it is) really stands out and pulls your eye to the difference even though the rest of the image is so busy.', '2004-04-28 17:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(689496, 72753, 6845, '<td valign="top">I love this image. Great colors and dof. The coposition works really well also.</td>', 'I love this image. Great colors and dof. The coposition works really well also.', '2004-04-28 17:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(689498, 72775, 14614, '<td valign="top">Yikes on the butt crack!  otherwise clever idea - B&amp;W works as does the dark, grainy feel</td>', 'Yikes on the butt crack!  otherwise clever idea - B&W works as does the dark, grainy feel', '2004-04-28 17:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(689499, 72350, 7322, '<td valign="top">There is too much going on here. Perhaps if you had concentrated on only one or two elements of this landscape?  Lines leading into the image can be a good design element but here they are stopped short by the fountain which is to small to be the main focus and which interrupts the progression to the building. The building is impressive enough that you could have stood in front of the fountain to get the shot. As it is, it is too far back in the frame and there is not enough contrast between the building and the sky. I also think this is an ugly building and the landscaping is bad and it is probably influencing how I see this picture.</td>', 'There is too much going on here. Perhaps if you had concentrated on only one or two elements of this landscape?  Lines leading into the image can be a good design element but here they are stopped short by the fountain which is to small to be the main focus and which interrupts the progression to the building. The building is impressive enough that you could have stood in front of the fountain to get the shot. As it is, it is too far back in the frame and there is not enough contrast between the building and the sky. I also think this is an ugly building and the landscaping is bad and it is probably influencing how I see this picture.', '2004-04-28 17:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(689500, 72771, 6845, '<td valign="top">This is a great image. I am going to assume a pane of glass was used but I am probably wrong. Great colors and composition.</td>', 'This is a great image. I am going to assume a pane of glass was used but I am probably wrong. Great colors and composition.', '2004-04-28 17:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(689501, 71931, 14053, '<td valign="top">The is somewhat distracting</td>', 'The is somewhat distracting', '2004-04-28 17:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(689502, 72629, 14614, '<td valign="top">This is the first "Toy" shot in all the challenges that has ever worked (IMHO); dusty area on right side of main subject distracts a bit.</td>', 'This is the first "Toy" shot in all the challenges that has ever worked (IMHO); dusty area on right side of main subject distracts a bit.', '2004-04-28 17:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(689503, 72515, 7322, '<td valign="top">There is not enough contrast of design elements for me to get excited by this image. It has a washed out quality.</td>', 'There is not enough contrast of design elements for me to get excited by this image. It has a washed out quality.', '2004-04-28 17:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(689504, 71860, 6845, '<td valign="top">One of the best animal images I have seen on the site for some time. Way to go on getting in close and making this an interesting shot. The composition is good and so is the focus.</td>', 'One of the best animal images I have seen on the site for some time. Way to go on getting in close and making this an interesting shot. The composition is good and so is the focus.', '2004-04-28 17:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(689505, 72764, 14614, '<td valign="top">cropping is a bit tight on the bottom of both bottles, I like the reflection of one bottle on the other (creative lighting!)</td>', 'cropping is a bit tight on the bottom of both bottles, I like the reflection of one bottle on the other (creative lighting!)', '2004-04-28 17:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(689507, 72153, 6845, '<td valign="top">The sky in this image is just wild. Must have alot os air trafic in this area. Well lit and I like the angle of view and the composition.</td>', 'The sky in this image is just wild. Must have alot os air trafic in this area. Well lit and I like the angle of view and the composition.', '2004-04-28 17:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(689508, 71501, 14614, '<td valign="top">I like this shot  (the half black half subject balance, color, close-up of the eye are great)... title is a bit goofy, wish the far left was in focus</td>', 'I like this shot  (the half black half subject balance, color, close-up of the eye are great)... title is a bit goofy, wish the far left was in focus', '2004-04-28 17:55:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(689509, 72341, 6845, '<td valign="top">This image looks crazy. The dof in this really makes it work. The seperation from her face to her body is done really well.</td>', 'This image looks crazy. The dof in this really makes it work. The seperation from her face to her body is done really well.', '2004-04-28 17:55:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(689511, 72513, 6845, '<td valign="top">This might not make sense, but I love the brite, dull yellow color of this image. It is brite because of the yellow color, yet it looks overcast or something giving it a nice shadowed look.</td>', 'This might not make sense, but I love the brite, dull yellow color of this image. It is brite because of the yellow color, yet it looks overcast or something giving it a nice shadowed look.', '2004-04-28 17:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(689512, 72788, 14614, '<td valign="top">a bit of a goofy title; expressions are good, lighting on the right "subject" needs to be stronger as he/you fades into the background</td>', 'a bit of a goofy title; expressions are good, lighting on the right "subject" needs to be stronger as he/you fades into the background', '2004-04-28 17:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(689513, 72276, 6845, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy the light in this image. It is very warm and soft. The image has a nice pastel quality to it.</td>', 'I really enjoy the light in this image. It is very warm and soft. The image has a nice pastel quality to it.', '2004-04-28 17:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(689514, 72639, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice boy and his dog shot. I''m not sure that duotone is working very hard here. Placing your models in front of a less distracting background would have gone a long way toward making this fabulous instead of just cute. It is a bit high key for my taste. It looks like exposure came from the sky instead of something more neutral--the boy''s face or the dog''s fur for instance. See how the detail in the white sneakers are completely washed out? You can''t see where the sneakers end and the socks begin. The subject does meet the challenge.</td>', 'This is a nice boy and his dog shot. I''m not sure that duotone is working very hard here. Placing your models in front of a less distracting background would have gone a long way toward making this fabulous instead of just cute. It is a bit high key for my taste. It looks like exposure came from the sky instead of something more neutral--the boy''s face or the dog''s fur for instance. See how the detail in the white sneakers are completely washed out? You can''t see where the sneakers end and the socks begin. The subject does meet the challenge.', '2004-04-28 17:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(689515, 71657, 14614, '<td valign="top">great lighting!</td>', 'great lighting!', '2004-04-28 18:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(689517, 72401, 6845, '<td valign="top">At first I didn''t like the graininess of the image. But after looking at it a little longer I really started to like everything about this image. It would look great printed out on water color paper. By the way, was the grain intentional or was it just what the camera gave you to work with? In any case I would really like to now if it was done through a process so that I may be able to apply it to some of my images int eh future.</td>', 'At first I didn''t like the graininess of the image. But after looking at it a little longer I really started to like everything about this image. It would look great printed out on water color paper. By the way, was the grain intentional or was it just what the camera gave you to work with? In any case I would really like to now if it was done through a process so that I may be able to apply it to some of my images int eh future.', '2004-04-28 18:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(689520, 72659, 6845, '<td valign="top">I really like the color and the compositiion. The choice of focus works good for me as well. It does look to be a bit over sharpened however. In any case I really like this image.</td>', 'I really like the color and the compositiion. The choice of focus works good for me as well. It does look to be a bit over sharpened however. In any case I really like this image.', '2004-04-28 18:03:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(689521, 71955, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image. I would have waited for the background to be free of people before shooting. Also, it took me a moment to notice there was a third, smaller child. I would have waited until the girl lowered the toy she is holding so little boy''s face could be seen. It''s also a bit overexposed looking. It meets the challenge.</td>', 'This is a nice image. I would have waited for the background to be free of people before shooting. Also, it took me a moment to notice there was a third, smaller child. I would have waited until the girl lowered the toy she is holding so little boy''s face could be seen. It''s also a bit overexposed looking. It meets the challenge.', '2004-04-28 18:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(689522, 72508, 14614, '<td valign="top">wonderful!  funny, good title, excellent expression.  everything a shot for this challenge should be (and a bit more)</td>', 'wonderful!  funny, good title, excellent expression.  everything a shot for this challenge should be (and a bit more)', '2004-04-28 18:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(689524, 71372, 7322, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t know what this is and as an abstraction it does nothing for me.</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t know what this is and as an abstraction it does nothing for me.', '2004-04-28 18:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(689525, 72467, 6845, '<td valign="top">I really like the color pallete that this image has to it. The composition and angle are very pleasing. A very interesting looking building.</td>', 'I really like the color pallete that this image has to it. The composition and angle are very pleasing. A very interesting looking building.', '2004-04-28 18:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(689529, 72173, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is kind of a ho-hum cityscape. Those concrete tanks and the brick building in front of them don''t hold enough visual interest to be a focal point. The trees in the foreground are just distracting and out of focus. I see potential for an interesting shot in the buildings and the river in the upper right quadrant.</td>', 'This is kind of a ho-hum cityscape. Those concrete tanks and the brick building in front of them don''t hold enough visual interest to be a focal point. The trees in the foreground are just distracting and out of focus. I see potential for an interesting shot in the buildings and the river in the upper right quadrant.', '2004-04-28 18:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(689531, 72670, 7322, '<td valign="top">There is too much negative space directly to the right of the ant. If you had eliminated the background and used the flower as the background for the ant, framing the ant in the lower right, while also focusing on the ant, you might have captured something. As it is, the ant is out of focus and distracting. In other words, you have conflciting focal points. You have to choose either the ant or the flower.</td>', 'There is too much negative space directly to the right of the ant. If you had eliminated the background and used the flower as the background for the ant, framing the ant in the lower right, while also focusing on the ant, you might have captured something. As it is, the ant is out of focus and distracting. In other words, you have conflciting focal points. You have to choose either the ant or the flower.', '2004-04-28 18:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(689534, 71981, 7322, '<td valign="top">I kind of like this as a candid portrait but I don''t see how it meets the challenge. I like the extreme of placing the subject to the very edge of the frame with the expanse of water and sky filling the rest. I guess in a way the composition demonstrates proportion. I think your title has thrown me off. Fill-flash would reveal more detail in the subject''s face, although you might have lost that intriguing blur of his hand at the edge. Overall, I think it''s an effective image.</td>', 'I kind of like this as a candid portrait but I don''t see how it meets the challenge. I like the extreme of placing the subject to the very edge of the frame with the expanse of water and sky filling the rest. I guess in a way the composition demonstrates proportion. I think your title has thrown me off. Fill-flash would reveal more detail in the subject''s face, although you might have lost that intriguing blur of his hand at the edge. Overall, I think it''s an effective image.', '2004-04-28 18:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(689537, 72660, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure why you chose to include the other tiny furniture in the background. It only takes one to  illustrate the point and the others just distract, particularly chair that looks like it is in the act of tipping over. The hand reaching for the chair should be in much sharper focus. Difficult with a close-up, I know.</td>', 'I''m not sure why you chose to include the other tiny furniture in the background. It only takes one to  illustrate the point and the others just distract, particularly chair that looks like it is in the act of tipping over. The hand reaching for the chair should be in much sharper focus. Difficult with a close-up, I know.', '2004-04-28 18:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(689540, 72534, 7322, '<td valign="top">A funny idea. Not an overly successfull image. The bug isn''t in focus enough to make an impact. Most of the gun barrel is also out of focus.</td>', 'A funny idea. Not an overly successfull image. The bug isn''t in focus enough to make an impact. Most of the gun barrel is also out of focus.', '2004-04-28 18:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(689545, 72140, 7322, '<td valign="top">The title is uneccessary and leaves the impression that the owner of the adult sized boots is dead. <br/>It''s a reasonably pleasing still life but it doesn''t move me. I usually like contrast but there is a bit too much here and too much loss of detail.</td>', 'The title is uneccessary and leaves the impression that the owner of the adult sized boots is dead. It''s a reasonably pleasing still life but it doesn''t move me. I usually like contrast but there is a bit too much here and too much loss of detail.', '2004-04-28 18:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(689549, 72789, 17580, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea</td>', 'Interesting idea', '2004-04-28 18:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(689552, 72732, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a cute dog shot but this pose really doesn''t convey ''all ears'' to me. The muzzle is also quite large, as are his droopy eyes. I guess what I''m trying to say is his ears don''t look out of proportion with his face. If this were a Basset puppy which hasn''t grown into its ears the statement would be more powerful.</td>', 'This is a cute dog shot but this pose really doesn''t convey ''all ears'' to me. The muzzle is also quite large, as are his droopy eyes. I guess what I''m trying to say is his ears don''t look out of proportion with his face. If this were a Basset puppy which hasn''t grown into its ears the statement would be more powerful.', '2004-04-28 18:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(689555, 72779, 19511, '<td valign="top">LOL...is this some kind of dinosaur....i think its called cowouria-milkuria..:)<br/></td>', 'LOL...is this some kind of dinosaur....i think its called cowouria-milkuria..:)', '2004-04-28 18:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(689557, 71842, 16095, '<td valign="top">nice use of proportion</td>', 'nice use of proportion', '2004-04-28 18:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(689558, 72050, 7322, '<td valign="top">This daffodil is not a good example of symetry. The petals vary greatly in size and shape and placement and the two petals which look about to fall off deter from the natural proportions of the flower (proportion does not equal symetry although symetry equals proportion). The background is very dull and should have been eliminated as much as possible. The hand holding the flower is also distracting.</td>', 'This daffodil is not a good example of symetry. The petals vary greatly in size and shape and placement and the two petals which look about to fall off deter from the natural proportions of the flower (proportion does not equal symetry although symetry equals proportion). The background is very dull and should have been eliminated as much as possible. The hand holding the flower is also distracting.', '2004-04-28 18:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(689559, 72775, 16095, '<td valign="top">great shot-wish it wasn''t so grainy<br/></td>', 'great shot-wish it wasn''t so grainy', '2004-04-28 18:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(689560, 72772, 8005, '<td valign="top">Wow, some who actually knows what proportion is!</td>', 'Wow, some who actually knows what proportion is!', '2004-04-28 18:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(689562, 71955, 16095, '<td valign="top">i love this!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'i love this!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!', '2004-04-28 18:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(689563, 71718, 8005, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture(7)</td>', 'Very nice picture(7)', '2004-04-28 18:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(689564, 72729, 16488, '<td valign="top">Great capture!   Love the light in the bee''s eye!  Color seems a little pale but it doesn''t really detratct that much.  Graininess at the extremes doesn''t feel right though.</td>', 'Great capture!   Love the light in the bee''s eye!  Color seems a little pale but it doesn''t really detratct that much.  Graininess at the extremes doesn''t feel right though.', '2004-04-28 18:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(689565, 71630, 8005, '<td valign="top">Nice proportions.</td>', 'Nice proportions.', '2004-04-28 18:35:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(689567, 71954, 8005, '<td valign="top">That perspective.....</td>', 'That perspective.....', '2004-04-28 18:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(689568, 72192, 7322, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what the intention was here. This is a snail on a thorny stalk of some kind? Shooting from above was a bad choice.  The snail, obviously meant to be the subject, is overwhelmed by being placed in the midst of all those thorns and, worse, the blurry, uninteresting background that takes up 3/4 of the picture plane. Mentally divide this picture into quadrants and you will see what I mean.</td>', 'I have no idea what the intention was here. This is a snail on a thorny stalk of some kind? Shooting from above was a bad choice.  The snail, obviously meant to be the subject, is overwhelmed by being placed in the midst of all those thorns and, worse, the blurry, uninteresting background that takes up 3/4 of the picture plane. Mentally divide this picture into quadrants and you will see what I mean.', '2004-04-28 18:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(689570, 71974, 16095, '<td valign="top">nice comp and detail</td>', 'nice comp and detail', '2004-04-28 18:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(689572, 72625, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective.  A little more sharpness on the foreground would be my preference.  The one largest circle at top left and its associated blur are bothersome to me.  Rainbows seem to draw too much attention to themselves.  Good idea overall.  Worth a re-visit.</td>', 'Nice perspective.  A little more sharpness on the foreground would be my preference.  The one largest circle at top left and its associated blur are bothersome to me.  Rainbows seem to draw too much attention to themselves.  Good idea overall.  Worth a re-visit.', '2004-04-28 18:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(689574, 72076, 20822, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see all of the bow of the vessel</td>', 'Would have liked to see all of the bow of the vessel', '2004-04-28 18:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(689576, 72807, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity and composition of this shot. The black and white works well with the achromatic nature of the subject. I might like to see more of the face of the key, so that it''s more obvious what the object is. But l like the forced perspective and matte nature of the keys with the grainines of the film.</td>', 'I like the simplicity and composition of this shot. The black and white works well with the achromatic nature of the subject. I might like to see more of the face of the key, so that it''s more obvious what the object is. But l like the forced perspective and matte nature of the keys with the grainines of the film.', '2004-04-28 18:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(689577, 72508, 16095, '<td valign="top">this is hilarious -good job</td>', 'this is hilarious -good job', '2004-04-28 18:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(689578, 72627, 7322, '<td valign="top">This would have been far more effective if you had removed the distracting stems---the one directly behind the flower and the one pointing to it from the left edge of the frame. Also, it looks like you focused on the foliage rather than the flower.</td>', 'This would have been far more effective if you had removed the distracting stems---the one directly behind the flower and the one pointing to it from the left edge of the frame. Also, it looks like you focused on the foliage rather than the flower.', '2004-04-28 18:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(689581, 71973, 20822, '<td valign="top">Great idea. What does it look like w/ out the car?</td>', 'Great idea. What does it look like w/ out the car?', '2004-04-28 18:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(689582, 72592, 16488, '<td valign="top">Intense close-up!  Very nice pattern.  Greater depth of field would have brought the sepa into the pattern more--don''t know if it would also flatten the subject too much, though.  And just to be really, really picky--the pollen flecks dirty up the image.  Nice one.  Luck!</td>', 'Intense close-up!  Very nice pattern.  Greater depth of field would have brought the sepa into the pattern more--don''t know if it would also flatten the subject too much, though.  And just to be really, really picky--the pollen flecks dirty up the image.  Nice one.  Luck!', '2004-04-28 18:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(689583, 72528, 20822, '<td valign="top">I like it</td>', 'I like it', '2004-04-28 18:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(689586, 72773, 20822, '<td valign="top">Wow must be nice to live close to that view</td>', 'Wow must be nice to live close to that view', '2004-04-28 18:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(689587, 72651, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting attempt but it doesn''t really grab me; possibly because the hands are out of focus and the extended pinky fingers interrupt the triangle shape the hands were creating. You could have had a triangle within a triangle if you had just kept your fingers together.</td>', 'Interesting attempt but it doesn''t really grab me; possibly because the hands are out of focus and the extended pinky fingers interrupt the triangle shape the hands were creating. You could have had a triangle within a triangle if you had just kept your fingers together.', '2004-04-28 18:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(689591, 71827, 7322, '<td valign="top">If I understood the culture I might have a clue white this picture was about. I like the strong contrast of red, white, and black. I also like the interesting negative space created by the sillouhettes of the men.</td>', 'If I understood the culture I might have a clue white this picture was about. I like the strong contrast of red, white, and black. I also like the interesting negative space created by the sillouhettes of the men.', '2004-04-28 18:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(689592, 72499, 19780, '<td valign="top">I love the combination of textures and colors of surfaces here. I''d like a little less jumble in the composition and would consider removing the doormats. I''m not sure if I''m missing how this relates to Proportion, but I''m not letting that influence my scoring so much on this challenge.</td>', 'I love the combination of textures and colors of surfaces here. I''d like a little less jumble in the composition and would consider removing the doormats. I''m not sure if I''m missing how this relates to Proportion, but I''m not letting that influence my scoring so much on this challenge.', '2004-04-28 18:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(689598, 72563, 16488, '<td valign="top">Hilarious!  Wish you could eliminate the red bush behind the one vase--it fights for attendtion.  Perhaps a different point-of-view, if possible?  Closer cropping might help the viewer see the intention.  And, now that I think about it is the vase with flowers really helping here?  Neat idea.</td>', 'Hilarious!  Wish you could eliminate the red bush behind the one vase--it fights for attendtion.  Perhaps a different point-of-view, if possible?  Closer cropping might help the viewer see the intention.  And, now that I think about it is the vase with flowers really helping here?  Neat idea.', '2004-04-28 18:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(689601, 72589, 7322, '<td valign="top">I don''t find this a pleasing arrangement of these two watering cans. If it weren''t for the title I would wonder why you chose to place them like this. This just doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'I don''t find this a pleasing arrangement of these two watering cans. If it weren''t for the title I would wonder why you chose to place them like this. This just doesn''t work for me.', '2004-04-28 18:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(689606, 72005, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a strong image. I don''t love it but it works for me.</td>', 'This is a strong image. I don''t love it but it works for me.', '2004-04-28 18:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(689607, 72508, 19780, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, it''s whimsical and a great interpretation of the challange. I''d love to see the dog''s eye just a little bit lower so we can see his brow a bit, and maybe a bit more contrast inside the dollhouse and maybe more context with the doll furniture or other furnishings.</td>', 'I really like this shot, it''s whimsical and a great interpretation of the challange. I''d love to see the dog''s eye just a little bit lower so we can see his brow a bit, and maybe a bit more contrast inside the dollhouse and maybe more context with the doll furniture or other furnishings.', '2004-04-28 18:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(689608, 72282, 19753, '<td valign="top">Cute kid and great concept</td>', 'Cute kid and great concept', '2004-04-28 18:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(689611, 72516, 16488, '<td valign="top">This photo has a lot going on!  Make one want to study it.<br/> <br/>Odd thing happens to me when I view it--it flips in and out so that the lower left of the billboard seems to be the near corner at times.  (Weird.)</td>', 'This photo has a lot going on!  Make one want to study it. Odd thing happens to me when I view it--it flips in and out so that the lower left of the billboard seems to be the near corner at times.  (Weird.)', '2004-04-28 18:50:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(689612, 71485, 19780, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, wonderfully sharp. I like the detail and the scale of the young leaf compared to the mature ones.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, wonderfully sharp. I like the detail and the scale of the young leaf compared to the mature ones.', '2004-04-28 18:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(689615, 71716, 7322, '<td valign="top">This photograph is way out of focus and really should not have been entered for consideration. Good editing is an important part of good photography.</td>', 'This photograph is way out of focus and really should not have been entered for consideration. Good editing is an important part of good photography.', '2004-04-28 18:51:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(689616, 72466, 20481, '<td valign="top">a bit overexposed</td>', 'a bit overexposed', '2004-04-28 18:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(689621, 72000, 16488, '<td valign="top">Really nice idea!  I like the limited use of color, the contrast of natural and line forms, and the balance of the lighting.  The cropping bothers me, though--I wish the tip of the middle finger and the crotch of the thumb were in the frame.  Luck!</td>', 'Really nice idea!  I like the limited use of color, the contrast of natural and line forms, and the balance of the lighting.  The cropping bothers me, though--I wish the tip of the middle finger and the crotch of the thumb were in the frame.  Luck!', '2004-04-28 18:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(689626, 72342, 19116, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  IMO more light/contrast would help bring out the berries.  A flash would work fine for this even though its outside because the stuff in the background is so far away.</td>', 'Nice composition.  IMO more light/contrast would help bring out the berries.  A flash would work fine for this even though its outside because the stuff in the background is so far away.', '2004-04-28 18:55:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(689629, 72669, 7322, '<td valign="top">This just doesn''t do it for me. I think it might be the weird swirly blue background with the glowing spheres. I''m also not thrilled with the arrangment of the pawns in relation to the king.</td>', 'This just doesn''t do it for me. I think it might be the weird swirly blue background with the glowing spheres. I''m also not thrilled with the arrangment of the pawns in relation to the king.', '2004-04-28 18:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(689630, 72489, 19116, '<td valign="top">A larger (more pixels) would bring out the detail in the moss and the reflection better.</td>', 'A larger (more pixels) would bring out the detail in the moss and the reflection better.', '2004-04-28 18:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(689634, 72228, 19116, '<td valign="top">great colors.  Maybe would look better with the vent in a different place in the composition...  No, I think you cropped well.  7.</td>', 'great colors.  Maybe would look better with the vent in a different place in the composition...  No, I think you cropped well.  7.', '2004-04-28 19:00:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(689637, 72788, 19116, '<td valign="top">Clever.  The line down the face on the left has something to do with the double exposure I guess...  Like the grainy look.</td>', 'Clever.  The line down the face on the left has something to do with the double exposure I guess...  Like the grainy look.', '2004-04-28 19:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(689639, 71959, 7322, '<td valign="top">An image like this needs greater contrast to make it really pop. Otherwise I like it. It could be improved in PS.</td>', 'An image like this needs greater contrast to make it really pop. Otherwise I like it. It could be improved in PS.', '2004-04-28 19:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(689643, 72076, 19116, '<td valign="top">Impressive.  It might have been even more imposing if you had cropped the water out so the ship was just against the sky.  Definitely a great representation of "Huge" proportions.</td>', 'Impressive.  It might have been even more imposing if you had cropped the water out so the ship was just against the sky.  Definitely a great representation of "Huge" proportions.', '2004-04-28 19:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(689644, 72495, 7322, '<td valign="top">You should pay more attention to your background. That pebbly, vinyl texture does nothing for this. The glares on the bottles, particularly on the smaller one, really subtract points from this. The static, boring arrangement is the final blow. I don''t understand why you chose to lay the bottles flat like this.</td>', 'You should pay more attention to your background. That pebbly, vinyl texture does nothing for this. The glares on the bottles, particularly on the smaller one, really subtract points from this. The static, boring arrangement is the final blow. I don''t understand why you chose to lay the bottles flat like this.', '2004-04-28 19:08:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(689646, 72488, 8005, '<td valign="top">Not very original</td>', 'Not very original', '2004-04-28 19:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(689647, 72593, 19116, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Sort of a "horn of plenty" effect.  If there were some way to stage the picture so there was just grass and sky in the background I think it would have been more dramatic.  Nice bright greens.</td>', 'Great idea.  Sort of a "horn of plenty" effect.  If there were some way to stage the picture so there was just grass and sky in the background I think it would have been more dramatic.  Nice bright greens.', '2004-04-28 19:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(689649, 71912, 18191, '<td valign="top">Very good capture of this concept which can sometimes go terrible...only problem here is the line going across the center.</td>', 'Very good capture of this concept which can sometimes go terrible...only problem here is the line going across the center.', '2004-04-28 19:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(689650, 72776, 7322, '<td valign="top">This picture is far to drab and overexposed. The subject is almost completely lacking in detail due to bad focusing. This just looks like an amateur travel snapshot.</td>', 'This picture is far to drab and overexposed. The subject is almost completely lacking in detail due to bad focusing. This just looks like an amateur travel snapshot.', '2004-04-28 19:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(689651, 72534, 19116, '<td valign="top">lol. 7.</td>', 'lol. 7.', '2004-04-28 19:10:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(689652, 71842, 18191, '<td valign="top">Horizon is a horizontal--good job!</td>', 'Horizon is a horizontal--good job!', '2004-04-28 19:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(689654, 72269, 19116, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Like the blues.  Background is a little blurry.  Stop aperature down a little, maybe use manual focus?  Or maybe its the JPEG encoding...</td>', 'Great idea.  Like the blues.  Background is a little blurry.  Stop aperature down a little, maybe use manual focus?  Or maybe its the JPEG encoding...', '2004-04-28 19:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(689656, 72785, 19116, '<td valign="top">Great night scene.  8.</td>', 'Great night scene.  8.', '2004-04-28 19:14:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(689658, 72733, 15920, '<td valign="top">Too small to really appreciate.</td>', 'Too small to really appreciate.', '2004-04-28 19:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(689659, 72160, 19116, '<td valign="top">Cool picture.  Like the pollen.  Maybe you could adjst hue/saturation or brightness/contrast to bring out the bug and put the petals more in the background.</td>', 'Cool picture.  Like the pollen.  Maybe you could adjst hue/saturation or brightness/contrast to bring out the bug and put the petals more in the background.', '2004-04-28 19:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(689661, 72405, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like what you were attempting here. The man is definitely has a look of longing or adoration on his face. Unfortuantely, the ice sculpture and the loudspeaker smack dab in the center are hard to overlook. Not a lot you can do about that except perhaps move a little to the right and take the shot at a slight angle. At least then the two distractions wouldn''t completelly overlap as they are now. Lowering the viewpoint a couple of inches to include more of the audience would have helped. As they are now, they are distracting blury details (particularly the bald head). Including a bit more of them would have made a nice contrast with the man who is facing the opposite direction but also has his eyes fixed on the model. Lowering the viewpoint and cropping that inch of space above the model''s head would have put him on an even higher plane than the audience and reduced that large chunk of blue in the upper right to a less important chunk of blue. High marks because I like the moment you captured in the man''s expression.</td>', 'I like what you were attempting here. The man is definitely has a look of longing or adoration on his face. Unfortuantely, the ice sculpture and the loudspeaker smack dab in the center are hard to overlook. Not a lot you can do about that except perhaps move a little to the right and take the shot at a slight angle. At least then the two distractions wouldn''t completelly overlap as they are now. Lowering the viewpoint a couple of inches to include more of the audience would have helped. As they are now, they are distracting blury details (particularly the bald head). Including a bit more of them would have made a nice contrast with the man who is facing the opposite direction but also has his eyes fixed on the model. Lowering the viewpoint and cropping that inch of space above the model''s head would have put him on an even higher plane than the audience and reduced that large chunk of blue in the upper right to a less important chunk of blue. High marks because I like the moment you captured in the man''s expression.', '2004-04-28 19:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(689662, 72781, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is too washed out looking and all those rocks in the background are distracting. It needs greater contrast and shorter depth of field.</td>', 'This is too washed out looking and all those rocks in the background are distracting. It needs greater contrast and shorter depth of field.', '2004-04-28 19:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(689663, 71881, 19116, '<td valign="top">Pretty photo.  I''d like to see what it looked like cropped just below their feet.</td>', 'Pretty photo.  I''d like to see what it looked like cropped just below their feet.', '2004-04-28 19:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(689667, 72664, 7322, '<td valign="top">The placement of the two fenceposts frames that tiny railing, giving it far more prominence then it deserves. The huge expanse of concrete in the foreground does nothing considering it takes up a third of the frame.  Moving in closer would have eliminated that and possibly eliminated the railing as well leaving the fence posts to act as a framing device for the ocean which should then be focused much better to allow for more eyepopping color and detail. Judging by your title you meant to include the concrete walkway and the railing but a concept does not automatically translate into a pleasing composition.</td>', 'The placement of the two fenceposts frames that tiny railing, giving it far more prominence then it deserves. The huge expanse of concrete in the foreground does nothing considering it takes up a third of the frame.  Moving in closer would have eliminated that and possibly eliminated the railing as well leaving the fence posts to act as a framing device for the ocean which should then be focused much better to allow for more eyepopping color and detail. Judging by your title you meant to include the concrete walkway and the railing but a concept does not automatically translate into a pleasing composition.', '2004-04-28 19:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(689672, 72778, 7322, '<td valign="top">Without the title I don''t think I would have made the connection to a drumstick and I''m married to a professional drummer. Even with the title it''s a bit of a stretch since drumsticks have round, tapered tips not flat, cylindrical tips. The tower makes an imposing subject but this shot lacks tonal interest. Perhaps on a day when the sky was blue, or the clouds spectacular colors? A bit more focus on the colum would reveal more detail in the ridges and add textural interest to make up for the lack of tonal interest.</td>', 'Without the title I don''t think I would have made the connection to a drumstick and I''m married to a professional drummer. Even with the title it''s a bit of a stretch since drumsticks have round, tapered tips not flat, cylindrical tips. The tower makes an imposing subject but this shot lacks tonal interest. Perhaps on a day when the sky was blue, or the clouds spectacular colors? A bit more focus on the colum would reveal more detail in the ridges and add textural interest to make up for the lack of tonal interest.', '2004-04-28 19:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(689673, 72356, 15920, '<td valign="top">Title should have included the price, say 135 Euros?  The composition is strong, as is the color choices.  A few details would have really driven this home for me: polish up the flatware, and add a napkin and wine glass.</td>', 'Title should have included the price, say 135 Euros?  The composition is strong, as is the color choices.  A few details would have really driven this home for me: polish up the flatware, and add a napkin and wine glass.', '2004-04-28 19:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(689677, 72518, 7322, '<td valign="top">I can''t really tell what this is a statue of. The sun flare in the top left is very distracting. Is the statue reaching for the sky? If so, a different view point to simplify the background would have helped. The tall building just gets in the way unless you intended to frame the statue so she looked the same height as the building. Forced perspective can be fun but it only works when the background isn''t distracting.</td>', 'I can''t really tell what this is a statue of. The sun flare in the top left is very distracting. Is the statue reaching for the sky? If so, a different view point to simplify the background would have helped. The tall building just gets in the way unless you intended to frame the statue so she looked the same height as the building. Forced perspective can be fun but it only works when the background isn''t distracting.', '2004-04-28 19:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(689679, 72751, 15920, '<td valign="top">Those trainers look quite new.  Best get your child out hitting the pavement sooner rather than later....Legs are a bit grainy and a little more DOF would help, but this is a great image if you have ever been a parent.  -7</td>', 'Those trainers look quite new.  Best get your child out hitting the pavement sooner rather than later....Legs are a bit grainy and a little more DOF would help, but this is a great image if you have ever been a parent.  -7', '2004-04-28 19:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(689680, 72548, 16488, '<td valign="top">I love the peaceful tranquility of this photo.  Good eye to capture the color on the one boat without the distraction of color occuring elsewhere. Subject is expertly placed.  If there''s one thing to quibble with it''s the jaggy edges on the the rim of the near boat--perhaps a result of oversharpening?  (I don''t think it''s my screen, apologies if it is.)</td>', 'I love the peaceful tranquility of this photo.  Good eye to capture the color on the one boat without the distraction of color occuring elsewhere. Subject is expertly placed.  If there''s one thing to quibble with it''s the jaggy edges on the the rim of the near boat--perhaps a result of oversharpening?  (I don''t think it''s my screen, apologies if it is.)', '2004-04-28 19:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(689681, 72807, 15920, '<td valign="top">Very clever, and nicely done.  Title made this work really well.</td>', 'Very clever, and nicely done.  Title made this work really well.', '2004-04-28 19:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
