(689762, 71669, 14836, '<td valign="top">Very nice pic but perhaps a little too small.  Suits the challenge well.  A bit tilted but still appreciable.</td>', 'Very nice pic but perhaps a little too small.  Suits the challenge well.  A bit tilted but still appreciable.', '2004-04-28 20:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
