(689778, 72679, 2535, '<td valign="top">the frame is distracting</td>', 'the frame is distracting', '2004-04-28 20:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(689779, 72737, 7322, '<td valign="top">Are they checking out the size of his penis? He is looking directly down and she is looking down toward him so that''s my guess based on this challenge. But why such high key contrast?  The girls face and the guys shirt disappear into the background. Was this the intention? What is it saying about proportion? Why are they holding grey paper in front of themselves? This is really just a confusing jumble and doesn''t say much about proportion. The title isn''t working too hard for you either.</td>', 'Are they checking out the size of his penis? He is looking directly down and she is looking down toward him so that''s my guess based on this challenge. But why such high key contrast?  The girls face and the guys shirt disappear into the background. Was this the intention? What is it saying about proportion? Why are they holding grey paper in front of themselves? This is really just a confusing jumble and doesn''t say much about proportion. The title isn''t working too hard for you either.', '2004-04-28 20:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(689781, 71485, 2535, '<td valign="top">very nice colour</td>', 'very nice colour', '2004-04-28 20:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(689782, 72086, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a horribly blurry exposure and should not have been submitted. Careful editing means weeding out exposures like this.</td>', 'This is a horribly blurry exposure and should not have been submitted. Careful editing means weeding out exposures like this.', '2004-04-28 20:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(689783, 72637, 7322, '<td valign="top">Without the title, which doesn''t really convey much, the idea of near and far isn''t really apparent from this photo. As an image it lacks a focal point. The railroad tracks just point to a drab landscape of washed out looking trees.</td>', 'Without the title, which doesn''t really convey much, the idea of near and far isn''t really apparent from this photo. As an image it lacks a focal point. The railroad tracks just point to a drab landscape of washed out looking trees.', '2004-04-28 20:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(689784, 72104, 7322, '<td valign="top">Is this an MP3 player? I can''t tell because the details are completey washed out from overexposure. Are you comparing differently sized music formats? This meaning is obscure without the title to explain it. The title should not be doing the work of the photo. It fails as an abstract composition.</td>', 'Is this an MP3 player? I can''t tell because the details are completey washed out from overexposure. Are you comparing differently sized music formats? This meaning is obscure without the title to explain it. The title should not be doing the work of the photo. It fails as an abstract composition.', '2004-04-28 20:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(689786, 72556, 7322, '<td valign="top">A nice idea which does illustrate proportion. This image fails asthetically, however. It lacks impact and visual interest outside of the interesting texture of the bark.</td>', 'A nice idea which does illustrate proportion. This image fails asthetically, however. It lacks impact and visual interest outside of the interesting texture of the bark.', '2004-04-28 20:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
