(689807, 71912, 7322, '<td valign="top">Clever use of forced perspective and you did it right by keeping the background very simple. I like the color contrasts. I''m a little suspicious of that line that intersects the frame about two-thirds up but it looks like it could just be the line of shadow from a hilly landscape.</td>', 'Clever use of forced perspective and you did it right by keeping the background very simple. I like the color contrasts. I''m a little suspicious of that line that intersects the frame about two-thirds up but it looks like it could just be the line of shadow from a hilly landscape.', '2004-04-28 21:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(689809, 72764, 19256, '<td valign="top">I think you should have showed more of the bottom of the bottles. Seems uncentered. Good lighting, however.</td>', 'I think you should have showed more of the bottom of the bottles. Seems uncentered. Good lighting, however.', '2004-04-28 21:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(689811, 72032, 19256, '<td valign="top">You have nothing to compare proportionality to.</td>', 'You have nothing to compare proportionality to.', '2004-04-28 21:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(689812, 72508, 14836, '<td valign="top">great idea ! My favorite so far.</td>', 'great idea ! My favorite so far.', '2004-04-28 21:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
