(689828, 72798, 19256, '<td valign="top">Not very interesting.</td>', 'Not very interesting.', '2004-04-28 21:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(689829, 72785, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty skyline shot. Sadly,it seems quite a bit out of focus so a lot of  the impact is lost. The challenge has been met because one truly sees how huge this ship is when comparing it to the equally huge skyscrapers. High marks for overall composition and meeting the challenge.</td>', 'This is a very pretty skyline shot. Sadly,it seems quite a bit out of focus so a lot of  the impact is lost. The challenge has been met because one truly sees how huge this ship is when comparing it to the equally huge skyscrapers. High marks for overall composition and meeting the challenge.', '2004-04-28 21:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
