(689943, 72326, 10799, '<td valign="top">The crop really does not do this shot justice....half a face and some fingers really distract.  I think it would have been better with less people and more animal.</td>', 'The crop really does not do this shot justice....half a face and some fingers really distract.  I think it would have been better with less people and more animal.', '2004-04-28 22:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(689946, 72659, 19930, '<td valign="top">Outstanding. I love the reflections in the big raindrop.</td>', 'Outstanding. I love the reflections in the big raindrop.', '2004-04-28 22:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(689952, 71669, 19608, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite.  The subtle pastels are absolutely great.  I can see this on a Hallmark card.  Sky reflections on the snow add a very special touch.</td>', 'One of my favorite.  The subtle pastels are absolutely great.  I can see this on a Hallmark card.  Sky reflections on the snow add a very special touch.', '2004-04-28 23:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(689954, 72548, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice peaceful scene.  Great seeing.  Fogginess and light make the colors really pop.</td>', 'Nice peaceful scene.  Great seeing.  Fogginess and light make the colors really pop.', '2004-04-28 23:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(689957, 72600, 19608, '<td valign="top">A classic high key rendition.  One of my favorites.  The white background works perfectly.  Lighting setup right on.</td>', 'A classic high key rendition.  One of my favorites.  The white background works perfectly.  Lighting setup right on.', '2004-04-28 23:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(689960, 72631, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great high key shot - well composed and lighted.  My only minor complaint is the gray line where the "floor" meets the wall.  Great choice of shutter speed.</td>', 'Great high key shot - well composed and lighted.  My only minor complaint is the gray line where the "floor" meets the wall.  Great choice of shutter speed.', '2004-04-28 23:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(689961, 72465, 19608, '<td valign="top">Ah - so simple yet so effective.  The layering effect of the 2 different grasses , the brown dirt, and the sky is stunning.  I wonder what a very small white cloud would do to hep say "proportion."  But who cares - its a winner as is!</td>', 'Ah - so simple yet so effective.  The layering effect of the 2 different grasses , the brown dirt, and the sky is stunning.  I wonder what a very small white cloud would do to hep say "proportion."  But who cares - its a winner as is!', '2004-04-28 23:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(689981, 72561, 20102, '<td valign="top">It bothers me that the backdrop is backwards, and the right side needs to be tugged at.</td>', 'It bothers me that the backdrop is backwards, and the right side needs to be tugged at.', '2004-04-28 23:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(689992, 72086, 10799, '<td valign="top">This looks like it did not get compressed correctly.  I don''t know for sure what happened but on my screen it is blurry and has jagged edges around words and things.  The photo itself seems to need a bit of straightening.</td>', 'This looks like it did not get compressed correctly.  I don''t know for sure what happened but on my screen it is blurry and has jagged edges around words and things.  The photo itself seems to need a bit of straightening.', '2004-04-29 00:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(689995, 72735, 9747, '<td valign="top">This is great, made me laugh. Looks very good, the train must be a small-scale version and not the real thing... right? In any case, wonderful perspective and depth of field. The wires (behind the lady''s head) are a bit distracting, but not too bad. This fits the theme perfectly. Well done!</td>', 'This is great, made me laugh. Looks very good, the train must be a small-scale version and not the real thing... right? In any case, wonderful perspective and depth of field. The wires (behind the lady''s head) are a bit distracting, but not too bad. This fits the theme perfectly. Well done!', '2004-04-29 00:08:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(689996, 72190, 18719, '<td valign="top">awesome pic!!</td>', 'awesome pic!!', '2004-04-29 00:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(689997, 72538, 14700, '<td valign="top">I would have used a deeper DOF..... but hey, It''s your photo!  Nice work. 8.</td>', 'I would have used a deeper DOF..... but hey, It''s your photo!  Nice work. 8.', '2004-04-29 00:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(689999, 72548, 10799, '<td valign="top">The edge of the boat has some distortion. I am not sure if it is a jpeg compression problem or if it is blurry.  I love the colors and feel of the photo.</td>', 'The edge of the boat has some distortion. I am not sure if it is a jpeg compression problem or if it is blurry.  I love the colors and feel of the photo.', '2004-04-29 00:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(690000, 72737, 18719, '<td valign="top">nice !! my only 10. funny pic.</td>', 'nice !! my only 10. funny pic.', '2004-04-29 00:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(690001, 72571, 9747, '<td valign="top">Eeek! It''s the headless ghost! This would have been better if the guy had his head lifted up a bit for more impact. But I love the proportion between the shadow and the guy anyway. The color is very fitting, quite mood-invoking. Excellent job!</td>', 'Eeek! It''s the headless ghost! This would have been better if the guy had his head lifted up a bit for more impact. But I love the proportion between the shadow and the guy anyway. The color is very fitting, quite mood-invoking. Excellent job!', '2004-04-29 00:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(690002, 72771, 19841, '<td valign="top">It''s more clever than talented, and I don''t see the connection to the challenge "proportion".    Interesting in an abstract way, though.</td>', 'It''s more clever than talented, and I don''t see the connection to the challenge "proportion".    Interesting in an abstract way, though.', '2004-04-29 00:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(690005, 72751, 10799, '<td valign="top">This might be a bit better if you had been closer to the ground with less of an angle pointing down at the shoes.  I like the idea and the composition of this.</td>', 'This might be a bit better if you had been closer to the ground with less of an angle pointing down at the shoes.  I like the idea and the composition of this.', '2004-04-29 00:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(690009, 72397, 19841, '<td valign="top">The shallow depth of field has left you with only the leaves in focus.  And they aren''t the point of the picture!  The composition and exposure are good, and it''s on topic.  For me, humor works better in color, and b&amp;w for more "serious" things.</td>', 'The shallow depth of field has left you with only the leaves in focus.  And they aren''t the point of the picture!  The composition and exposure are good, and it''s on topic.  For me, humor works better in color, and b&w for more "serious" things.', '2004-04-29 00:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(690011, 72509, 19841, '<td valign="top">It definately took some skill to get that shot!  Good composition, lighting and focus.  Kinda creepygross, though.</td>', 'It definately took some skill to get that shot!  Good composition, lighting and focus.  Kinda creepygross, though.', '2004-04-29 00:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(690014, 72789, 19841, '<td valign="top">I thought rabbits were supposed to multiply, not divide ;)<br/> <br/>Good technique, though.</td>', 'I thought rabbits were supposed to multiply, not divide ;) Good technique, though.', '2004-04-29 00:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(690017, 72809, 9747, '<td valign="top">Very powerful, like an Ansel Adams photograph. Good choice in making this black and white. Not sure what the black speck is (buoy?) but it''d be great if it resembled more like a boat or just isn''t there at all. Either way, it would nicely show the vastness of the area. Love the clouds. Great picture!</td>', 'Very powerful, like an Ansel Adams photograph. Good choice in making this black and white. Not sure what the black speck is (buoy?) but it''d be great if it resembled more like a boat or just isn''t there at all. Either way, it would nicely show the vastness of the area. Love the clouds. Great picture!', '2004-04-29 00:23:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(690021, 72734, 20482, '<td valign="top">Wow.. What a shot!!</td>', 'Wow.. What a shot!!', '2004-04-29 00:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(690022, 72365, 19841, '<td valign="top">Making me laugh is always worth an extra point!</td>', 'Making me laugh is always worth an extra point!', '2004-04-29 00:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(690025, 72076, 20482, '<td valign="top">Was this taken in NYC?  I would have been there but I was at work.  This is a great shot showing proportion with the tugboat on her side.<br/>NICE</td>', 'Was this taken in NYC?  I would have been there but I was at work.  This is a great shot showing proportion with the tugboat on her side.NICE', '2004-04-29 00:29:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(690026, 72086, 19841, '<td valign="top">Something''s fuzzy here, but it isn''t the navel.  I think your shutter speed was slow enough to get a twitch blur.  Either that, or your resoulution is just too low.  It''s a good concept for the challenge, though.</td>', 'Something''s fuzzy here, but it isn''t the navel.  I think your shutter speed was slow enough to get a twitch blur.  Either that, or your resoulution is just too low.  It''s a good concept for the challenge, though.', '2004-04-29 00:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(690027, 72652, 9747, '<td valign="top">Hope the gal didn''t get sore arms after this! Very nice, though I have to nitpick on a few things: The picture is tilted too much to the right (off balance), the top is cut off, and I think it needs a little more contrast. Other than these, cute models, great concept. Kudos!</td>', 'Hope the gal didn''t get sore arms after this! Very nice, though I have to nitpick on a few things: The picture is tilted too much to the right (off balance), the top is cut off, and I think it needs a little more contrast. Other than these, cute models, great concept. Kudos!', '2004-04-29 00:31:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(690031, 72104, 19841, '<td valign="top">If I knew what this object was, I might have a better idea what the picture was about.</td>', 'If I knew what this object was, I might have a better idea what the picture was about.', '2004-04-29 00:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(690034, 72560, 9747, '<td valign="top">Very cute idea and fits the theme. However, picture is kind of bland (needs more contrast). The background, the box on the floor, and the white fluffy thing (dog?) in the foreground takes away the attention from the subjects. I''d love to see the mother''s face and the toddler''s mouth (without pacifier). All in all, great attempt!</td>', 'Very cute idea and fits the theme. However, picture is kind of bland (needs more contrast). The background, the box on the floor, and the white fluffy thing (dog?) in the foreground takes away the attention from the subjects. I''d love to see the mother''s face and the toddler''s mouth (without pacifier). All in all, great attempt!', '2004-04-29 00:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(690035, 72725, 19841, '<td valign="top">The lighting is too flat, your stems have disappeared.  Something''s too hot about the reds, as well.  I think it is the effect of using the flash with the non-directional sunlight.  Try disabling your flash, and taking more pictures!</td>', 'The lighting is too flat, your stems have disappeared.  Something''s too hot about the reds, as well.  I think it is the effect of using the flash with the non-directional sunlight.  Try disabling your flash, and taking more pictures!', '2004-04-29 00:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(690038, 72741, 9747, '<td valign="top">"Confusing"? Yes, it IS confusing! ;-) Not sure how this fits the proportion theme? Picture-wise, it needs more contrast and the red background shows wrinkles. Also, the image is too small.</td>', '"Confusing"? Yes, it IS confusing! ;-) Not sure how this fits the proportion theme? Picture-wise, it needs more contrast and the red background shows wrinkles. Also, the image is too small.', '2004-04-29 00:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
