(690081, 72651, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great idea and execution.  Colors work well.  Here''s my hints for an even better image:<br/> <br/>1) If the hands were "upside down"  the shape of the balloon would be echoed by the finger hole - both with the point point down.  That would add a bit for me.<br/> <br/>2) I don''t think you need the border.</td>', 'Great idea and execution.  Colors work well.  Here''s my hints for an even better image: 1) If the hands were "upside down"  the shape of the balloon would be echoed by the finger hole - both with the point point down.  That would add a bit for me. 2) I don''t think you need the border.', '2004-04-29 01:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(690084, 72751, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great clors, idea, and execution.  Add a bit of humor by putting the shoes on the wrong feet....</td>', 'Great clors, idea, and execution.  Add a bit of humor by putting the shoes on the wrong feet....', '2004-04-29 01:35:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(690085, 71835, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great handling of DOF.  I suspect this was a stationary ball - but it doesn''t matter - it works extremely well and makes the point dramatically.  Your border does nothing for you except detract from the image.</td>', 'Great handling of DOF.  I suspect this was a stationary ball - but it doesn''t matter - it works extremely well and makes the point dramatically.  Your border does nothing for you except detract from the image.', '2004-04-29 01:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(690086, 72775, 19608, '<td valign="top">Boy has some of the sand shifted!  Great idea and execution!  Graineness adds a nice touch.</td>', 'Boy has some of the sand shifted!  Great idea and execution!  Graineness adds a nice touch.', '2004-04-29 01:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(690096, 72508, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and execution.  The small amout of red arond the eye adds a great touch.</td>', 'Nice idea and execution.  The small amout of red arond the eye adds a great touch.', '2004-04-29 01:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(690098, 71642, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and shapes.</td>', 'Nice colors and shapes.', '2004-04-29 01:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(690100, 72356, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea.  Title is perfect.  Minor suggestions:  I''d like to see the silverware better aligned and with more "shininess" showing.  The yellow pattern on the knife is a bit distracting. I knoe that''s nitpicky but when you are so close to perfection... everything additional helps.  Good job.</td>', 'Wonderful idea.  Title is perfect.  Minor suggestions:  I''d like to see the silverware better aligned and with more "shininess" showing.  The yellow pattern on the knife is a bit distracting. I knoe that''s nitpicky but when you are so close to perfection... everything additional helps.  Good job.', '2004-04-29 01:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(690102, 72649, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice job!  Composition works well.</td>', 'Nice job!  Composition works well.', '2004-04-29 01:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
