(690108, 72796, 15381, '<td valign="top">ok...so i was skimming through photos with my roomate and he said that our school was in one of the pictures...i said, "no freakin way" and "quit lying".  However, it seems in you attempt to meet the challenge you have done that and met us...so to speak, thanks for the excitement at 12 am...10</td>', 'ok...so i was skimming through photos with my roomate and he said that our school was in one of the pictures...i said, "no freakin way" and "quit lying".  However, it seems in you attempt to meet the challenge you have done that and met us...so to speak, thanks for the excitement at 12 am...10', '2004-04-29 02:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
