(690116, 72651, 20786, '<td valign="top">I reeeallly like this!! I like the way the shape of the fingers mimics the shape of the balloon, only inverted.</td>', 'I reeeallly like this!! I like the way the shape of the fingers mimics the shape of the balloon, only inverted.', '2004-04-29 02:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(690117, 72105, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and texture.  The low light really shows proportion; your title might be better as the "shadowy" instead of shady... but that''s a minor detail.  Colors are very effective.  Overall a very strong submission.</td>', 'Nice composition and texture.  The low light really shows proportion; your title might be better as the "shadowy" instead of shady... but that''s a minor detail.  Colors are very effective.  Overall a very strong submission.', '2004-04-29 02:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
