(690119, 71485, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great title!  The backlighting on the fig leaves is superb - showing great detail in the veins.  I love the contrast in the light and dark green leaves.  The hint of pink in the baby leaf adds a nice touch. The only item on my "wish list" is a slightly darker blue sky - a minor point.  Nice job.</td>', 'Great title!  The backlighting on the fig leaves is superb - showing great detail in the veins.  I love the contrast in the light and dark green leaves.  The hint of pink in the baby leaf adds a nice touch. The only item on my "wish list" is a slightly darker blue sky - a minor point.  Nice job.', '2004-04-29 02:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(690128, 72491, 18838, '<td valign="top">this is a really great idea, but it seriously lacks contrast ... on my screen the black pawns are maybe 60-70% grey and the white ones are not white at all ... and the curtain (?) in the background very much distracts from the white pawns in the back ... needs a more uniform background</td>', 'this is a really great idea, but it seriously lacks contrast ... on my screen the black pawns are maybe 60-70% grey and the white ones are not white at all ... and the curtain (?) in the background very much distracts from the white pawns in the back ... needs a more uniform background', '2004-04-29 02:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
