(690360, 72810, 20204, '<td valign="top">Thanks for reminding me that creativity is what you make of it...  There''s a great image waiting to be taken wherever you may be.  I like the symmetry, and the depth of field on this.  Great shot!</td>', 'Thanks for reminding me that creativity is what you make of it...  There''s a great image waiting to be taken wherever you may be.  I like the symmetry, and the depth of field on this.  Great shot!', '2004-04-29 08:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
