(690477, 72571, 16488, '<td valign="top">Good idea for the challenge!  Somehow I think it would be better if the subject were not facing his shadow, but otherwise perfectly posed to create the effect.  The skewed horizontal adds to the effect of your theme.  Not crazy about the orange tone, but maybe you meant it to be disturbing.</td>', 'Good idea for the challenge!  Somehow I think it would be better if the subject were not facing his shadow, but otherwise perfectly posed to create the effect.  The skewed horizontal adds to the effect of your theme.  Not crazy about the orange tone, but maybe you meant it to be disturbing.', '2004-04-29 10:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(690478, 72495, 19841, '<td valign="top">Turn off the flash and try again.  The flash attached to the camera has burned out the label on the small bottle, and left the top of the large one dark.   The bottles would be better standing together on a table, or inside an opened cabinet,  rather than laying on.. whatever that is.  It would look more natural.</td>', 'Turn off the flash and try again.  The flash attached to the camera has burned out the label on the small bottle, and left the top of the large one dark.   The bottles would be better standing together on a table, or inside an opened cabinet,  rather than laying on.. whatever that is.  It would look more natural.', '2004-04-29 10:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
