(690498, 72539, 16488, '<td valign="top">The idea for proportion is alright--just not sure about the lighting. By backlighting the small piece you do make it stand out--but it''s a little overly bright.  The top of the pizza looks unappetizingly old, therefore not my slice either.</td>', 'The idea for proportion is alright--just not sure about the lighting. By backlighting the small piece you do make it stand out--but it''s a little overly bright.  The top of the pizza looks unappetizingly old, therefore not my slice either.', '2004-04-29 10:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
