(690503, 72490, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the image space. Colors very effectice together.</td>', 'Nice use of the image space. Colors very effectice together.', '2004-04-29 10:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(690504, 71945, 16488, '<td valign="top">That sure is strange ice!  I like the rainbow effect on it but wonder why it floats so high.  More backlighting might define the edges of the class.  Feel that the reflected light in the base competes with the "ice".</td>', 'That sure is strange ice!  I like the rainbow effect on it but wonder why it floats so high.  More backlighting might define the edges of the class.  Feel that the reflected light in the base competes with the "ice".', '2004-04-29 10:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(690508, 72815, 19841, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but weak presentation.  The composition is staic.  That chair rail in the background doesn''t help.  Even without finding another setting, this composition could have been improved by placing the two objects closer together, and cropping in close, to make a vertical image.  This would make the verticals stronger than the horizontals.  Right now, they are even.   As this image is, you can improve it by cropping all the dark off the bottom, and coming in as close as you can on the sides.</td>', 'Good idea, but weak presentation.  The composition is staic.  That chair rail in the background doesn''t help.  Even without finding another setting, this composition could have been improved by placing the two objects closer together, and cropping in close, to make a vertical image.  This would make the verticals stronger than the horizontals.  Right now, they are even.   As this image is, you can improve it by cropping all the dark off the bottom, and coming in as close as you can on the sides.', '2004-04-29 10:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(690509, 72735, 16488, '<td valign="top">The background gives this forced-perspective shot away too much and has many distracting elements.  The most unfortunate of these is the top of the chain-link fence cutting through your subjects.</td>', 'The background gives this forced-perspective shot away too much and has many distracting elements.  The most unfortunate of these is the top of the chain-link fence cutting through your subjects.', '2004-04-29 10:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(690511, 72763, 19841, '<td valign="top">A little more depth of field would have made this better.  As it is, neither clip is completely in focus.  This image also seems to be more about scale than proportion.  (clipping a big clip on a little letter would be proportion)</td>', 'A little more depth of field would have made this better.  As it is, neither clip is completely in focus.  This image also seems to be more about scale than proportion.  (clipping a big clip on a little letter would be proportion)', '2004-04-29 10:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(690515, 72549, 19841, '<td valign="top">It does indeed have beautiful proportions.</td>', 'It does indeed have beautiful proportions.', '2004-04-29 11:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
