(690631, 71716, 5391, '<td valign="top">Needs to be quite a bit sharper.  Maybe some creative side lighting would add interest, too.</td>', 'Needs to be quite a bit sharper.  Maybe some creative side lighting would add interest, too.', '2004-04-29 12:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(690633, 71669, 5391, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot - the pastel tones work really well.  I wish it were larger so I could see more detail.</td>', 'Lovely shot - the pastel tones work really well.  I wish it were larger so I could see more detail.', '2004-04-29 12:37:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(690637, 72593, 5391, '<td valign="top">I really like what you''ve done with the baskets - very nice.  If I put my hands up over the image to cover the black line at the top and the lighter colored bit of background on the left side of the image, making a square crop, I think it makes the shot much more interesting, really bringing attention to the baskets.  That one dandilion in front is a nice touch, too, btw.</td>', 'I really like what you''ve done with the baskets - very nice.  If I put my hands up over the image to cover the black line at the top and the lighter colored bit of background on the left side of the image, making a square crop, I think it makes the shot much more interesting, really bringing attention to the baskets.  That one dandilion in front is a nice touch, too, btw.', '2004-04-29 12:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(690639, 71954, 5391, '<td valign="top">The blown-out bit in the back left is distracting.  Perhaps a plainer background and a less centered subject would give this more punch.</td>', 'The blown-out bit in the back left is distracting.  Perhaps a plainer background and a less centered subject would give this more punch.', '2004-04-29 12:41:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(690640, 72530, 17055, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot! Love the attitude of each and every subject<br/></td>', 'Excellent shot! Love the attitude of each and every subject', '2004-04-29 12:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(690641, 71500, 5391, '<td valign="top">The high contrast works well in this image, making it very artistic.  8</td>', 'The high contrast works well in this image, making it very artistic.  8', '2004-04-29 12:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(690642, 72775, 17055, '<td valign="top">great shot! Nice concept.</td>', 'great shot! Nice concept.', '2004-04-29 12:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(690644, 72005, 5391, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and nice composition.  I''d like to see some warm-colored lighting to add a little mood and really bring out the rich browns and reds I see lurking in this picture.</td>', 'Nice shot and nice composition.  I''d like to see some warm-colored lighting to add a little mood and really bring out the rich browns and reds I see lurking in this picture.', '2004-04-29 12:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(690645, 71981, 5391, '<td valign="top">Nice off-balanced composition.  Horizon tilt is a bit of a problem, as are the cut off hands.</td>', 'Nice off-balanced composition.  Horizon tilt is a bit of a problem, as are the cut off hands.', '2004-04-29 12:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(690646, 72628, 17055, '<td valign="top">HOw do I know if it is? There is nothing here to show me that</td>', 'HOw do I know if it is? There is nothing here to show me that', '2004-04-29 12:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(690647, 72796, 5391, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that I see a photographic reason for the reflection in this image.  It sort of turns it into a confusing jumble of non-related items.</td>', 'I''m not sure that I see a photographic reason for the reflection in this image.  It sort of turns it into a confusing jumble of non-related items.', '2004-04-29 12:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(690649, 72775, 5391, '<td valign="top">This is clever!  I wish that either the bottom didn''t fade into darkness, or else that the top did - more even lighting, I guess, is what I mean.  But overall a creative shot with lots of human interest for the viewer.  7</td>', 'This is clever!  I wish that either the bottom didn''t fade into darkness, or else that the top did - more even lighting, I guess, is what I mean.  But overall a creative shot with lots of human interest for the viewer.  7', '2004-04-29 12:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(690650, 71809, 20455, '<td valign="top">Nice</td>', 'Nice', '2004-04-29 12:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
