(690769, 72787, 12573, '<td valign="top">Not seeing a real representation of proportion (or lack thereof) here.  The shot could be more interesting if the circular portion of the hotel was filling the entire frame.  The inclusion of the other elements on the beach in the photo takes away from the interest of the main subject.</td>', 'Not seeing a real representation of proportion (or lack thereof) here.  The shot could be more interesting if the circular portion of the hotel was filling the entire frame.  The inclusion of the other elements on the beach in the photo takes away from the interest of the main subject.', '2004-04-29 15:02:37.000000', NULL, 1),
