(690899, 72560, 16095, '<td valign="top">this is a nice idea-would you reconsider shooting this same shot but on a white background and getting close to the subjects -easy way to do this would be to tape some white butcher''s paper OR white non-wrinkled bed sheet to wall and set up 3 lamps w/o thier shades for lighting-try it in black &amp; white mode( &amp; no flash) or have subjects wearing all white.  I would love to see the reshoot if you do it!</td>', 'this is a nice idea-would you reconsider shooting this same shot but on a white background and getting close to the subjects -easy way to do this would be to tape some white butcher''s paper OR white non-wrinkled bed sheet to wall and set up 3 lamps w/o thier shades for lighting-try it in black & white mode( & no flash) or have subjects wearing all white.  I would love to see the reshoot if you do it!', '2004-04-29 17:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
