(691359, 72276, 19608, '<td valign="top">This is a very hard one for me to make comments about - I find some of the image exceptional but yet have problems with other areas.  1) The late afternoon lighting on the faces, hair, and the right side of the white robe is "perfect."  What a nice feel!  The sky, on the other hand, should not be so bright.  Overall - a very nice image.  The black-white-line border - for me - is slightly below neutral. (Ithink it would be better without it.)<br/></td>', 'This is a very hard one for me to make comments about - I find some of the image exceptional but yet have problems with other areas.  1) The late afternoon lighting on the faces, hair, and the right side of the white robe is "perfect."  What a nice feel!  The sky, on the other hand, should not be so bright.  Overall - a very nice image.  The black-white-line border - for me - is slightly below neutral. (Ithink it would be better without it.)', '2004-04-30 02:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
