(691366, 72779, 19608, '<td valign="top">The red of the model''s costume pops!.  Great that it is in the shadowed area. Overall - this is an image I really want to love...but the competition with the trees at the top and the planter at the bottom right reduces the impact.  Go back and do it again!  The "cow''s" head is a bit over-exposed.</td>', 'The red of the model''s costume pops!.  Great that it is in the shadowed area. Overall - this is an image I really want to love...but the competition with the trees at the top and the planter at the bottom right reduces the impact.  Go back and do it again!  The "cow''s" head is a bit over-exposed.', '2004-04-30 02:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(691367, 71781, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is a bit out of focus, and the pliers distract from your message.</td>', 'This is a bit out of focus, and the pliers distract from your message.', '2004-04-30 02:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(691369, 72082, 19608, '<td valign="top">The colors of the image are near perfect.  My biggest problem is that the house tilts downhill from right to left.</td>', 'The colors of the image are near perfect.  My biggest problem is that the house tilts downhill from right to left.', '2004-04-30 02:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(691372, 72592, 19608, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice image; the colors work well together.  Composition should perhaps include the "cutoff" areas at the top and bottom - but that''s a minor point.  The most distracting point is that the top of the stamen is very soft/</td>', 'This is a very nice image; the colors work well together.  Composition should perhaps include the "cutoff" areas at the top and bottom - but that''s a minor point.  The most distracting point is that the top of the stamen is very soft/', '2004-04-30 02:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(691373, 72817, 19608, '<td valign="top">Clever idea!  Held DOF very well through the glass.  The very bright spots to the right of your model''s forehead are unfortunate.</td>', 'Clever idea!  Held DOF very well through the glass.  The very bright spots to the right of your model''s forehead are unfortunate.', '2004-04-30 02:34:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(691374, 72789, 19608, '<td valign="top">A lot of potential - colors work well - nice subject.  But... proportion?</td>', 'A lot of potential - colors work well - nice subject.  But... proportion?', '2004-04-30 02:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(691375, 72015, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great reflection!  Just added a point upon closer inspection.</td>', 'Great reflection!  Just added a point upon closer inspection.', '2004-04-30 02:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(691376, 72754, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea.  Maybe a shot a bit too much from the bottom - but not much.</td>', 'Very nice idea.  Maybe a shot a bit too much from the bottom - but not much.', '2004-04-30 02:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(691377, 72590, 19608, '<td valign="top">Hmm. A different, but effective take on "proportion" - very nice idea.  My biggest problem is with your lighting - try it again  - emphasize the red and reduce the bright spots.</td>', 'Hmm. A different, but effective take on "proportion" - very nice idea.  My biggest problem is with your lighting - try it again  - emphasize the red and reduce the bright spots.', '2004-04-30 02:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
