(691379, 72228, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice "pattern shot" - great colors.  Not sure I can see any proportion....</td>', 'Very nice "pattern shot" - great colors.  Not sure I can see any proportion....', '2004-04-30 02:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(691380, 72769, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and nice rendering.</td>', 'Nice idea and nice rendering.', '2004-04-30 02:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(691381, 72140, 19608, '<td valign="top">The image is dynamic.  Great black and white rendition.  But - just when you get   into the subjects you realize the title is "first and last steps" - and it''s a real letdown. Is the owner of the large shoes about to take his last step? If that''s what you intended... it works.  But I''d prefer something more like "Grandpa helped me tie my laces..."  This is one of the very few images where the title had such an impact on me.</td>', 'The image is dynamic.  Great black and white rendition.  But - just when you get   into the subjects you realize the title is "first and last steps" - and it''s a real letdown. Is the owner of the large shoes about to take his last step? If that''s what you intended... it works.  But I''d prefer something more like "Grandpa helped me tie my laces..."  This is one of the very few images where the title had such an impact on me.', '2004-04-30 02:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(691383, 71603, 19608, '<td valign="top">Colors are nice and work well together.  But that''s it - not a great attempt at meeeting the challenge.</td>', 'Colors are nice and work well together.  But that''s it - not a great attempt at meeeting the challenge.', '2004-04-30 03:00:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(691385, 72226, 19608, '<td valign="top">Composition, lighting, exposure, and choice of backgroud are near perfect.  Proportion and artistic interest are weak.  Keep trying - it has great potential.</td>', 'Composition, lighting, exposure, and choice of backgroud are near perfect.  Proportion and artistic interest are weak.  Keep trying - it has great potential.', '2004-04-30 03:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(691386, 72450, 19608, '<td valign="top">Colors are very nice but composition is hard to read.</td>', 'Colors are very nice but composition is hard to read.', '2004-04-30 03:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(691388, 72539, 21028, '<td valign="top">awesome picture, i love it. the way you highlighted the slice is great good picture. the black looks good in this, very strong! i like it!</td>', 'awesome picture, i love it. the way you highlighted the slice is great good picture. the black looks good in this, very strong! i like it!', '2004-04-30 03:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
