(691790, 71757, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  Image meets the challenge well.</td>', 'Nice colors.  Image meets the challenge well.', '2004-04-30 12:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(691797, 72581, 19608, '<td valign="top">Moody - nice feel.</td>', 'Moody - nice feel.', '2004-04-30 13:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(691798, 72084, 19608, '<td valign="top">Animals coloring goes well with the wall color.</td>', 'Animals coloring goes well with the wall color.', '2004-04-30 13:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(691801, 72721, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and execution.  May be more effective in a diagonal composition.  The white border does noting for me.</td>', 'Nice idea and execution.  May be more effective in a diagonal composition.  The white border does noting for me.', '2004-04-30 13:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(691805, 72491, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.  Sure makes the point well.  The black/white border does nothing for me - it actually detracts.</td>', 'Nicely composed.  Sure makes the point well.  The black/white border does nothing for me - it actually detracts.', '2004-04-30 13:07:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(691806, 71956, 15920, '<td valign="top">Those guys look a little larger than life to me....anyway, nice crop.</td>', 'Those guys look a little larger than life to me....anyway, nice crop.', '2004-04-30 13:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(691807, 72737, 15920, '<td valign="top">Very overexposed.</td>', 'Very overexposed.', '2004-04-30 13:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(691811, 72737, 19608, '<td valign="top">Hmmm. great idea.  One of the most original in the challenge - an extra point for the creative approach.  It works well in black and white...but the girl''s face and the man''s shoulders blend into the white background.</td>', 'Hmmm. great idea.  One of the most original in the challenge - an extra point for the creative approach.  It works well in black and white...but the girl''s face and the man''s shoulders blend into the white background.', '2004-04-30 13:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(691813, 72153, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice colors - the contrails in the sky add some interest.</td>', 'Nice colors - the contrails in the sky add some interest.', '2004-04-30 13:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(691814, 72741, 15920, '<td valign="top">The color choices on this are excellent, but I honestly can''t tell what message you are trying to send.  Is this perfectly proportioned or completely lacking in proportion?  I think to make this strong, you might think about an object for reference size wise.</td>', 'The color choices on this are excellent, but I honestly can''t tell what message you are trying to send.  Is this perfectly proportioned or completely lacking in proportion?  I think to make this strong, you might think about an object for reference size wise.', '2004-04-30 13:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(691822, 71912, 20613, '<td valign="top">This is a great idea.  This photo definitely made me laugh.  Good job! <br/></td>', 'This is a great idea.  This photo definitely made me laugh.  Good job! ', '2004-04-30 13:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(691827, 71805, 15920, '<td valign="top">If that is your child, save this picture forever, my daughter is 9 now and those flowers would be no where nearly as impressive.  Photographically, I would recomend cropping a bit tighter, perhaps taking out the second tree from the left and about 1/2 inch above her head.  I think that would make the viewer focus on her as the star of the shot.</td>', 'If that is your child, save this picture forever, my daughter is 9 now and those flowers would be no where nearly as impressive.  Photographically, I would recomend cropping a bit tighter, perhaps taking out the second tree from the left and about 1/2 inch above her head.  I think that would make the viewer focus on her as the star of the shot.', '2004-04-30 13:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(691828, 71906, 15920, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred this in color, but this is a terribly fun picture anyway.</td>', 'I would have preferred this in color, but this is a terribly fun picture anyway.', '2004-04-30 13:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(691829, 72743, 15920, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t find a scale, and I was going to use the RMB and USD, but I had this idea exactly.  It could be a little sharper, but I hope you win anyway!  -10</td>', 'I couldn''t find a scale, and I was going to use the RMB and USD, but I had this idea exactly.  It could be a little sharper, but I hope you win anyway!  -10', '2004-04-30 13:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(691831, 72787, 15920, '<td valign="top">This is nicely lit, but I remember this hotel as seeming bigger.  Perhaps a tighter crop would give those not fortunate enough to live in beautiful San Diego the sense of scale involved in that building.</td>', 'This is nicely lit, but I remember this hotel as seeming bigger.  Perhaps a tighter crop would give those not fortunate enough to live in beautiful San Diego the sense of scale involved in that building.', '2004-04-30 13:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(691835, 72658, 13648, '<td valign="top">This is funny! But the focus is soft.</td>', 'This is funny! But the focus is soft.', '2004-04-30 13:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(691840, 72123, 13648, '<td valign="top">Dog gets lost in the background. The big tree in the middle draws all of the <br/>attention. Perhaps if you cropped so the foreground trees where used as<br/>a frame. Nice idea though.</td>', 'Dog gets lost in the background. The big tree in the middle draws all of the attention. Perhaps if you cropped so the foreground trees where used asa frame. Nice idea though.', '2004-04-30 13:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(691841, 72534, 18667, '<td valign="top">more light would have helped this image immensely</td>', 'more light would have helped this image immensely', '2004-04-30 13:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(691845, 71716, 15920, '<td valign="top">Image is too small to evaluate effectively.</td>', 'Image is too small to evaluate effectively.', '2004-04-30 13:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(691846, 72773, 15920, '<td valign="top">A polarizing filter would make this more beautiful than it already is.</td>', 'A polarizing filter would make this more beautiful than it already is.', '2004-04-30 13:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(691847, 72404, 15920, '<td valign="top">Very clever "lack of proportion" as I have no idea how big these are.  Only thing I can think to suggest is some extra fill lights to remove all shadows.</td>', 'Very clever "lack of proportion" as I have no idea how big these are.  Only thing I can think to suggest is some extra fill lights to remove all shadows.', '2004-04-30 13:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(691853, 72464, 20482, '<td valign="top">Im not to sure what you were going for here.</td>', 'Im not to sure what you were going for here.', '2004-04-30 13:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(691858, 72190, 20482, '<td valign="top">If you drink too much of it, you will be....</td>', 'If you drink too much of it, you will be....', '2004-04-30 14:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(691859, 72530, 20482, '<td valign="top">I love this!</td>', 'I love this!', '2004-04-30 14:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(691864, 71980, 9780, '<td valign="top">look Iclandish. Good collors and frameing.</td>', 'look Iclandish. Good collors and frameing.', '2004-04-30 14:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(691866, 72639, 9780, '<td valign="top">Big Dan rooles! :) Nice B/w and setup is just grate...</td>', 'Big Dan rooles! :) Nice B/w and setup is just grate...', '2004-04-30 14:33:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(691867, 71912, 17033, '<td valign="top">Can''t believe anyone asked for a validation.......despite complaints from some that we would see a lot of these shots, I think no-one could argue that this isn''t a great example. Well done for the set up</td>', 'Can''t believe anyone asked for a validation.......despite complaints from some that we would see a lot of these shots, I think no-one could argue that this isn''t a great example. Well done for the set up', '2004-04-30 14:35:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(691869, 72615, 9780, '<td valign="top">Just like home... :) Nice Sephia but I wonder how it was in collor?</td>', 'Just like home... :) Nice Sephia but I wonder how it was in collor?', '2004-04-30 14:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(691873, 71485, 9780, '<td valign="top">like the wiev.... If it is a flower behind the leaf i would like to see it more. 9</td>', 'like the wiev.... If it is a flower behind the leaf i would like to see it more. 9', '2004-04-30 14:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(691877, 72770, 9643, '<td valign="top">Compliments.  Meets the challenge and is nicely composed and executed.</td>', 'Compliments.  Meets the challenge and is nicely composed and executed.', '2004-04-30 14:45:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(691878, 72076, 17033, '<td valign="top">Briiliant curves and sense of scale. I''m always scared of missing bits off my subject but the cut off bow here actually adds to the impression of size. My only criticisms are that perhaps the hul could be made darker/more contrast as it is showing a lot of noise.....how about comparing before and after with NeatImage?....hope it''s a top-scorer for you</td>', 'Briiliant curves and sense of scale. I''m always scared of missing bits off my subject but the cut off bow here actually adds to the impression of size. My only criticisms are that perhaps the hul could be made darker/more contrast as it is showing a lot of noise.....how about comparing before and after with NeatImage?....hope it''s a top-scorer for you', '2004-04-30 14:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(691881, 72797, 16636, '<td valign="top">Bit dark, but great idea</td>', 'Bit dark, but great idea', '2004-04-30 14:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(691882, 72738, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice portrait. It definitely evokes a certain mood. I think it stretches the notion of proportion.</td>', 'This is a really nice portrait. It definitely evokes a certain mood. I think it stretches the notion of proportion.', '2004-04-30 14:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(691883, 72817, 9643, '<td valign="top">The composition is ok but I wonder if it would be a more startling image if just the eyes were cropped.  I can see how it was problematic to make the decision on just how to present it.  Clever idea.</td>', 'The composition is ok but I wonder if it would be a more startling image if just the eyes were cropped.  I can see how it was problematic to make the decision on just how to present it.  Clever idea.', '2004-04-30 14:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(691884, 71956, 7322, '<td valign="top">The real marines should be a bit more focused. Overall, I think this is a successful shot. I like the placement of the marines in the furthest edge of the frame.</td>', 'The real marines should be a bit more focused. Overall, I think this is a successful shot. I like the placement of the marines in the furthest edge of the frame.', '2004-04-30 14:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(691885, 72766, 17033, '<td valign="top">Biology not your strong-point?</td>', 'Biology not your strong-point?', '2004-04-30 14:52:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(691888, 72356, 9780, '<td valign="top">lol this is nice combo. . .  Only thing I see what I see about this pic is the knief.... :)</td>', 'lol this is nice combo. . .  Only thing I see what I see about this pic is the knief.... :)', '2004-04-30 14:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(691889, 72356, 19912, '<td valign="top">:-)</td>', ':-)', '2004-04-30 14:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(691890, 72013, 7322, '<td valign="top">Maybe if there were less distracting details this would be successful. I would suggest cropping the edge on the right to include only the street and some of the tree (which can''t be helped), and cropping the bottom to exclude the parking lot.</td>', 'Maybe if there were less distracting details this would be successful. I would suggest cropping the edge on the right to include only the street and some of the tree (which can''t be helped), and cropping the bottom to exclude the parking lot.', '2004-04-30 14:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(691891, 72086, 17033, '<td valign="top">Don''t drink and focus</td>', 'Don''t drink and focus', '2004-04-30 14:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(691892, 72508, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is funny and makes for an original animal portrait. It effectively meets the challenge. My favorite of all those I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'This is funny and makes for an original animal portrait. It effectively meets the challenge. My favorite of all those I''ve seen so far.', '2004-04-30 14:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(691896, 72791, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice candid. I like the one red jersey in the field of navy. Your title suggest other intentions but I''m going to accept the color proportions as meeting the challenge (I don''t think the title suggest too much of an abstraction to count toward meeting the challenge).</td>', 'This is a nice candid. I like the one red jersey in the field of navy. Your title suggest other intentions but I''m going to accept the color proportions as meeting the challenge (I don''t think the title suggest too much of an abstraction to count toward meeting the challenge).', '2004-04-30 15:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(691900, 71603, 7322, '<td valign="top">This shows you how much guys love their games. Not one of them is looking at this girl''s beautiful proportions! My husband (not a sports fan) would have a hard time tearing his eyes away. <br/>This is a humorous and well-done candid and I like it. I''m inclined to think that without the suggestive title this would not meet the challenge.</td>', 'This shows you how much guys love their games. Not one of them is looking at this girl''s beautiful proportions! My husband (not a sports fan) would have a hard time tearing his eyes away. This is a humorous and well-done candid and I like it. I''m inclined to think that without the suggestive title this would not meet the challenge.', '2004-04-30 15:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(691903, 72753, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nearly perfect wildlife shot. I would suggest cropping it at the point where the road meets the strip of grass. I think it meets the challenge. I like that the bird has plenty of detail; you can tell what it has in it''s bill and you can see the ruffling of the feathers quite distinctly. Good job!</td>', 'This is a nearly perfect wildlife shot. I would suggest cropping it at the point where the road meets the strip of grass. I think it meets the challenge. I like that the bird has plenty of detail; you can tell what it has in it''s bill and you can see the ruffling of the feathers quite distinctly. Good job!', '2004-04-30 15:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(691916, 71881, 18722, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of dead space at the bottom, a tighter crop would help.</td>', 'There is a lot of dead space at the bottom, a tighter crop would help.', '2004-04-30 15:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(691920, 71835, 18722, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Did you manage to not get hit? :D  I do not care for the frame at all.</td>', 'Nice shot.  Did you manage to not get hit? :D  I do not care for the frame at all.', '2004-04-30 15:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(691921, 72769, 18722, '<td valign="top">The old VW shape is definitely better.  Very nice choice of monotone as well.</td>', 'The old VW shape is definitely better.  Very nice choice of monotone as well.', '2004-04-30 15:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(691923, 71973, 18722, '<td valign="top">The image would have worked better with the model (and all of the shadow) in the frame.</td>', 'The image would have worked better with the model (and all of the shadow) in the frame.', '2004-04-30 15:49:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(691924, 72741, 18722, '<td valign="top">Yes, very confusing why you made such a good entry so small.</td>', 'Yes, very confusing why you made such a good entry so small.', '2004-04-30 15:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(691935, 72491, 19795, '<td valign="top">The best interpretation of this challenge that I''ve seen yet.</td>', 'The best interpretation of this challenge that I''ve seen yet.', '2004-04-30 16:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(691942, 72754, 5900, '<td valign="top">Your photographs almost always have a double whammy meaning AND are always right on topic. It is enjoyable to look at an image and try and find the deeper meaning.  In that way,  by making someone have to think, you truly make taking pictures an art. I look forward to your evolving style.<br/></td>', 'Your photographs almost always have a double whammy meaning AND are always right on topic. It is enjoyable to look at an image and try and find the deeper meaning.  In that way,  by making someone have to think, you truly make taking pictures an art. I look forward to your evolving style.', '2004-04-30 16:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(691947, 72516, 20458, '<td valign="top">Proportion? Am I missing sometihing.</td>', 'Proportion? Am I missing sometihing.', '2004-04-30 16:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(691949, 72341, 20458, '<td valign="top">Proportion?</td>', 'Proportion?', '2004-04-30 16:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(691951, 72478, 20458, '<td valign="top">Best one using buildiings.</td>', 'Best one using buildiings.', '2004-04-30 16:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(691952, 72528, 20458, '<td valign="top">I know its the point, but a little to dark.</td>', 'I know its the point, but a little to dark.', '2004-04-30 16:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(691953, 72047, 20458, '<td valign="top">This the best one of the using pre-existing large objects.</td>', 'This the best one of the using pre-existing large objects.', '2004-04-30 16:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(691957, 71960, 18191, '<td valign="top">I like it, but proportion?</td>', 'I like it, but proportion?', '2004-04-30 16:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(691958, 72523, 20458, '<td valign="top">Best use of measing spoons.</td>', 'Best use of measing spoons.', '2004-04-30 16:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(691964, 72679, 15642, '<td valign="top">I''d lose the distracting border. It overwhelms the image.</td>', 'I''d lose the distracting border. It overwhelms the image.', '2004-04-30 16:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(691967, 72589, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I would reconsider the unflattering border.</td>', 'Nicely done. I would reconsider the unflattering border.', '2004-04-30 16:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(691969, 72105, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nice. I may reconsider the title.</td>', 'Nice. I may reconsider the title.', '2004-04-30 16:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(691972, 71948, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nice, but the border is a distraction.</td>', 'Nice, but the border is a distraction.', '2004-04-30 16:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(691978, 72514, 1570, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is really cute! I thought about doing something like that with my shepherd mix and miniature schnauzer, just sticking the little dawg under the belly of the other one, but this is much better! Mine wouldve never stayed like that! I love this! The shadows are a little distracting, but I love it anyway, a 10 from me! Will make this my favorite as soon as the challenge is over</td>', 'Oh, this is really cute! I thought about doing something like that with my shepherd mix and miniature schnauzer, just sticking the little dawg under the belly of the other one, but this is much better! Mine wouldve never stayed like that! I love this! The shadows are a little distracting, but I love it anyway, a 10 from me! Will make this my favorite as soon as the challenge is over', '2004-04-30 16:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(691980, 72045, 15642, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I''d lose the borde</td>', 'Nice, but I''d lose the borde', '2004-04-30 16:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(691982, 71955, 20653, '<td valign="top">Proportion indeed.</td>', 'Proportion indeed.', '2004-04-30 16:54:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(691986, 72714, 20653, '<td valign="top">Not really</td>', 'Not really', '2004-04-30 16:55:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(691992, 72795, 15642, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Very well done. 10.</td>', 'Great shot! Very well done. 10.', '2004-04-30 16:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(691994, 71835, 15642, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure the border is helping you here.</td>', 'I''m not sure the border is helping you here.', '2004-04-30 17:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(691998, 72659, 19780, '<td valign="top">Lovely demonstration of proportion - the different sizes of the drops of water, with the largest one pushing its boundaries. Nice color saturation. I find the out of focus blade in the foreground a little distracting to the overall composition. Very nice ... gives me a soothing feeling.</td>', 'Lovely demonstration of proportion - the different sizes of the drops of water, with the largest one pushing its boundaries. Nice color saturation. I find the out of focus blade in the foreground a little distracting to the overall composition. Very nice ... gives me a soothing feeling.', '2004-04-30 17:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(692000, 72047, 19780, '<td valign="top">I love the subject - the idea of a bat as tall as a building fits the challenge topic perfectly. I wish I could see the top of the bat - the composition leads my eye there and then I''m off in nothingness without the little endcap to allow my eye to come back down to the bottom of the frame again (and I think the edge of the building would do that). Nice colors. I''d like to be able to read the sign on the wall of the building a little better.</td>', 'I love the subject - the idea of a bat as tall as a building fits the challenge topic perfectly. I wish I could see the top of the bat - the composition leads my eye there and then I''m off in nothingness without the little endcap to allow my eye to come back down to the bottom of the frame again (and I think the edge of the building would do that). Nice colors. I''d like to be able to read the sign on the wall of the building a little better.', '2004-04-30 17:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(692005, 72104, 19780, '<td valign="top">The stark symmetry of this shot is interesting, but I''d also like the focus to be just as crisp. I''d like a bit more interesting lighting on it too - it took me a while to figure out what the background was, but I like the abstract nature of it.</td>', 'The stark symmetry of this shot is interesting, but I''d also like the focus to be just as crisp. I''d like a bit more interesting lighting on it too - it took me a while to figure out what the background was, but I like the abstract nature of it.', '2004-04-30 17:10:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(692007, 71501, 19780, '<td valign="top">Wonderful closeup shot and depth of field. Nicely framed and composed. The strange white wirey hair kind of messes up the composition for me - I''m drawn to it because it doesn''t seem to fit in. (I know you can''t just go up and pluck it out though!)</td>', 'Wonderful closeup shot and depth of field. Nicely framed and composed. The strange white wirey hair kind of messes up the composition for me - I''m drawn to it because it doesn''t seem to fit in. (I know you can''t just go up and pluck it out though!)', '2004-04-30 17:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(692010, 72561, 19780, '<td valign="top">A good composition for the challenge. I like the choice of subject. I wish the shot was bigger and crisper so that I could see the details better.</td>', 'A good composition for the challenge. I like the choice of subject. I wish the shot was bigger and crisper so that I could see the details better.', '2004-04-30 17:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(692014, 72679, 11895, '<td valign="top">I think it would be better with more image and less border</td>', 'I think it would be better with more image and less border', '2004-04-30 17:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(692016, 72778, 19780, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetry and I like how the clouds seem to be swirling around the tower. The saturation and contrast could really be bumped to make the tower pop like it should.</td>', 'Nice symmetry and I like how the clouds seem to be swirling around the tower. The saturation and contrast could really be bumped to make the tower pop like it should.', '2004-04-30 17:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(692019, 71948, 19780, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this and the soothing nature of all of the continuity of the pebbles. The composition doesn''t thrill me, as it is only color that''s guiding me to the larger rock, not necessarily its size, as the challenge of proportion would dictate. I don''t usually like borders, but this one "contains" the image well.</td>', 'I love the colors in this and the soothing nature of all of the continuity of the pebbles. The composition doesn''t thrill me, as it is only color that''s guiding me to the larger rock, not necessarily its size, as the challenge of proportion would dictate. I don''t usually like borders, but this one "contains" the image well.', '2004-04-30 17:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(692021, 72660, 15810, '<td valign="top">Love the hand in the background, really gives a sense of proportion. Great Job</td>', 'Love the hand in the background, really gives a sense of proportion. Great Job', '2004-04-30 17:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(692025, 72448, 15810, '<td valign="top">nice angle and nice lighting.</td>', 'nice angle and nice lighting.', '2004-04-30 17:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(692028, 72625, 15810, '<td valign="top">Love this, really out of the ordinary. Great work</td>', 'Love this, really out of the ordinary. Great work', '2004-04-30 17:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(692029, 72571, 15810, '<td valign="top">nice idea, good work. Were the lights orange or didnt you change the White Balance of the camera?</td>', 'nice idea, good work. Were the lights orange or didnt you change the White Balance of the camera?', '2004-04-30 17:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(692030, 72350, 15810, '<td valign="top">Pity the sun isnt on the front of the building.</td>', 'Pity the sun isnt on the front of the building.', '2004-04-30 17:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(692033, 71881, 15810, '<td valign="top">Great DOF. Personally I would have cropped it vertically a bit. i.e. lost a bit of black.</td>', 'Great DOF. Personally I would have cropped it vertically a bit. i.e. lost a bit of black.', '2004-04-30 17:30:35.000000', NULL, 1);
