(692324, 72389, 8370, '<td valign="top">Hrm.  You''re probably getting a lot of squeamish people voting this one down.  But .. it does show proportions!  This looks like a candid, so you really can''t control the lighting, but if this had been all in sunlight or all in shade, it probably would have been a little better.</td>', 'Hrm.  You''re probably getting a lot of squeamish people voting this one down.  But .. it does show proportions!  This looks like a candid, so you really can''t control the lighting, but if this had been all in sunlight or all in shade, it probably would have been a little better.', '2004-04-30 22:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(692326, 72350, 8370, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  Too bad the time of day made the sun at that angle.  Would have really been great to see more brightness on the main part of the building. 8.</td>', 'Nice shot!  Too bad the time of day made the sun at that angle.  Would have really been great to see more brightness on the main part of the building. 8.', '2004-04-30 22:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(692327, 72393, 8370, '<td valign="top">I think maybe this is more perspective than proportion, but I really like it!  Border adds instead of distracting, like so many do.  Also, I like the low lighting, as it enhances the "mood" of the subject.</td>', 'I think maybe this is more perspective than proportion, but I really like it!  Border adds instead of distracting, like so many do.  Also, I like the low lighting, as it enhances the "mood" of the subject.', '2004-04-30 22:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(692331, 72538, 8370, '<td valign="top">Creative way to fit the challenge!  I like that the measuring spoons are colored instead of the usual white.  Also, glad to see you used different spices and herbs to brighten up the shot.  Too bad you''re not allowed to clone out the bit of lighting flare on some of the spoons. 9.</td>', 'Creative way to fit the challenge!  I like that the measuring spoons are colored instead of the usual white.  Also, glad to see you used different spices and herbs to brighten up the shot.  Too bad you''re not allowed to clone out the bit of lighting flare on some of the spoons. 9.', '2004-04-30 22:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(692332, 72581, 8370, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and the way the boats are facing away from each other.  Nice title, too!</td>', 'Love the colors and the way the boats are facing away from each other.  Nice title, too!', '2004-04-30 22:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(692333, 71572, 8370, '<td valign="top">Might have more "pop" if it were in color, but it''s definitely a good proportional shot.</td>', 'Might have more "pop" if it were in color, but it''s definitely a good proportional shot.', '2004-04-30 22:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(692337, 72098, 14202, '<td valign="top">The person to the tree, the tree to the world...love the composition, love the colours ...well done</td>', 'The person to the tree, the tree to the world...love the composition, love the colours ...well done', '2004-04-30 22:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(692340, 72548, 8370, '<td valign="top">Wow, I really like this shot!  Shows proportion on a couple of levels: the boat in relation to the other boats and in relation to the water.  The fog really makes this shot have a mystical feel to it.  The color of the boat against the green/blue water really makes it stand out nicely.  10.</td>', 'Wow, I really like this shot!  Shows proportion on a couple of levels: the boat in relation to the other boats and in relation to the water.  The fog really makes this shot have a mystical feel to it.  The color of the boat against the green/blue water really makes it stand out nicely.  10.', '2004-04-30 22:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(692343, 72665, 8370, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective that makes the proportions seem even more blown out than they probably are.  Good framing!</td>', 'Interesting perspective that makes the proportions seem even more blown out than they probably are.  Good framing!', '2004-04-30 22:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(692346, 72342, 14202, '<td valign="top">If the yellow you refer to is the colour of the plants berries...then it is very hard to distinguish them...maybe a bit more in fill light.</td>', 'If the yellow you refer to is the colour of the plants berries...then it is very hard to distinguish them...maybe a bit more in fill light.', '2004-04-30 22:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(692348, 72571, 8370, '<td valign="top">Love this idea!  The color of the lights really makes this picture eerie, which matches with the posture to tell a story.  Good job. 9.</td>', 'Love this idea!  The color of the lights really makes this picture eerie, which matches with the posture to tell a story.  Good job. 9.', '2004-04-30 22:33:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(692349, 72642, 8370, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit too dark on the left and in the center to see the true proportions you''re trying to capture.  Clever idea, though!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-05-06 18:28:16.</i></td>', 'The lighting is a bit too dark on the left and in the center to see the true proportions you''re trying to capture.  Clever idea, though!', '2004-04-30 22:34:34.000000', '2004-05-06 19:28:16.000000', 1),
(692351, 72732, 8370, '<td valign="top">Adorable!!! 8.</td>', 'Adorable!!! 8.', '2004-04-30 22:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
