(693131, 72565, 12151, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. If you''re trying to contrast the real body versus the barbie, I would''ve liked you to show more of the shape of the upper body of the barbie.  That would''ve emphasized more how crazy the doll''s proportions are.  The photo does make you pause nonetheless - because it isn''t clear immediately if that''s a real woman or not on the left.  Very nice.</td>', 'Interesting photo. If you''re trying to contrast the real body versus the barbie, I would''ve liked you to show more of the shape of the upper body of the barbie.  That would''ve emphasized more how crazy the doll''s proportions are.  The photo does make you pause nonetheless - because it isn''t clear immediately if that''s a real woman or not on the left.  Very nice.', '2004-05-01 22:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
