(693389, 72625, 15274, '<td valign="top">absolutely beautiful.<br/>reminds me of summer lounging in the morning grass. <br/>i wish i had a copy for my wall. <br/> <br/> <br/>(proportion isn''t so immediately apparent... but who cares.)</td>', 'absolutely beautiful.reminds me of summer lounging in the morning grass. i wish i had a copy for my wall.   (proportion isn''t so immediately apparent... but who cares.)', '2004-05-02 04:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(693394, 72793, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice perspective.  The relative size of the bridge as it fades into the distance works well.  Unfortunately, there is little "pizzazz" for me in the image.</td>', 'Very nice perspective.  The relative size of the bridge as it fades into the distance works well.  Unfortunately, there is little "pizzazz" for me in the image.', '2004-05-02 04:45:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(693395, 72467, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very unusual/unreal colors - but they work well.</td>', 'Very unusual/unreal colors - but they work well.', '2004-05-02 04:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(693396, 72523, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Very nice execution.  Diagonal composition works.  But... no real "zing" for me.  You have a lot of technical ability - keep working at the final step.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Very nice execution.  Diagonal composition works.  But... no real "zing" for me.  You have a lot of technical ability - keep working at the final step.', '2004-05-02 04:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(693397, 72797, 19608, '<td valign="top">Colors work well be seem a bit unnatural.  The far end of the tunnel is a great idea bur seems to be floating in a dark space.</td>', 'Colors work well be seem a bit unnatural.  The far end of the tunnel is a great idea bur seems to be floating in a dark space.', '2004-05-02 04:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(693398, 71944, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors, great reflection.  Artistically, it seems like 4 different images however.  I''d go back and try the same shot with the water full of circular patterns - or something to give it more reality.</td>', 'Wonderful colors, great reflection.  Artistically, it seems like 4 different images however.  I''d go back and try the same shot with the water full of circular patterns - or something to give it more reality.', '2004-05-02 04:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(693400, 72571, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very sad  Shadown is superb - nice seeing.</td>', 'Very sad  Shadown is superb - nice seeing.', '2004-05-02 05:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(693401, 72643, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice high key image.  The stems of the glasses just below the bowls are nice.</td>', 'Nice high key image.  The stems of the glasses just below the bowls are nice.', '2004-05-02 05:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(693402, 72298, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice idea,  assume you were tring to show "lack of proportion"!  That woulf br one gigantic ship!  Very nice execution - exposure and DoF right on.</td>', 'Nice idea,  assume you were tring to show "lack of proportion"!  That woulf br one gigantic ship!  Very nice execution - exposure and DoF right on.', '2004-05-02 05:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(693405, 72298, 21084, '<td valign="top">monopoly at your house must take quite a while</td>', 'monopoly at your house must take quite a while', '2004-05-02 05:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(693427, 72490, 20899, '<td valign="top">Very nice reflection..the colors are splendid..well composed....</td>', 'Very nice reflection..the colors are splendid..well composed....', '2004-05-02 08:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(693435, 72098, 3273, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, gives a good sense of scale.  Nice colours.  Could have had a better title though!</td>', 'Nice shot, gives a good sense of scale.  Nice colours.  Could have had a better title though!', '2004-05-02 09:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(693436, 72730, 3273, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, great sense of warmth.  Nice colours.</td>', 'Lovely shot, great sense of warmth.  Nice colours.', '2004-05-02 09:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(693437, 72754, 3273, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, great colours.  Could maybe have had a little more even lighting around the edges of the carton.  Like the title too!</td>', 'Nice shot, great colours.  Could maybe have had a little more even lighting around the edges of the carton.  Like the title too!', '2004-05-02 09:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(693447, 72625, 20732, '<td valign="top">I was torn about how much I liked this one. On one hand, I really like the photo!!! On the other hand, the focus is a bit lacking. I guess if the grass wasn''t quite as close to the camera it might have worked a bit more effectivly.</td>', 'I was torn about how much I liked this one. On one hand, I really like the photo!!! On the other hand, the focus is a bit lacking. I guess if the grass wasn''t quite as close to the camera it might have worked a bit more effectivly.', '2004-05-02 10:13:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(693448, 72725, 20732, '<td valign="top">Nice photo. Looks a bit flat though. And not 100% sure how this relates to proportion.</td>', 'Nice photo. Looks a bit flat though. And not 100% sure how this relates to proportion.', '2004-05-02 10:14:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(693450, 72509, 20732, '<td valign="top">The chicken (it''s a chicken right?) is quite blurry which makes the photo hard to look at. Nice idea though.</td>', 'The chicken (it''s a chicken right?) is quite blurry which makes the photo hard to look at. Nice idea though.', '2004-05-02 10:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(693458, 72571, 20024, '<td valign="top">Great contrast between the man and the house,it can describe a depression being locked in a institution,great picture. 10.<br/></td>', 'Great contrast between the man and the house,it can describe a depression being locked in a institution,great picture. 10.', '2004-05-02 10:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(693462, 72405, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like it.</td>', 'I like it.', '2004-05-02 10:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(693463, 72664, 6130, '<td valign="top">Nice and very good.</td>', 'Nice and very good.', '2004-05-02 10:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(693464, 72797, 6130, '<td valign="top">So true and a good pic.</td>', 'So true and a good pic.', '2004-05-02 10:58:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(693512, 71718, 18868, '<td valign="top">good idea, the lighting is a little flat.  I think the DOF is neither here nor there -- it''s not blurry enough to be a "technique" but not sharp enough to feel complete.  Shooting from further away but zooming in, and manually setting a small apeture will help achieve a full-frame focus.</td>', 'good idea, the lighting is a little flat.  I think the DOF is neither here nor there -- it''s not blurry enough to be a "technique" but not sharp enough to feel complete.  Shooting from further away but zooming in, and manually setting a small apeture will help achieve a full-frame focus.', '2004-05-02 12:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(693514, 72589, 18868, '<td valign="top">That''s an attractive composition and nicely lit &amp; shot, but the duotone color is a little much for my taste.</td>', 'That''s an attractive composition and nicely lit & shot, but the duotone color is a little much for my taste.', '2004-05-02 12:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(693516, 71906, 20613, '<td valign="top">This is adorable!  I love it. 10.<br/></td>', 'This is adorable!  I love it. 10.', '2004-05-02 12:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(693519, 71829, 18868, '<td valign="top">You''ve really nailed the idea for the challenge -- good light too.  My only critical comment would be that the pinwheel is too central -- I''d like to see it more to the left -- I want to instantly know that the stick of the pinwheel isn''t part of the windmill.  As is, it takes a moment to ''read'' it as separate objects.  Should score well within the top 30!!</td>', 'You''ve really nailed the idea for the challenge -- good light too.  My only critical comment would be that the pinwheel is too central -- I''d like to see it more to the left -- I want to instantly know that the stick of the pinwheel isn''t part of the windmill.  As is, it takes a moment to ''read'' it as separate objects.  Should score well within the top 30!!', '2004-05-02 12:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(693524, 72581, 18868, '<td valign="top">So sweet!  I''d venture to guess this belongs in the top 10.</td>', 'So sweet!  I''d venture to guess this belongs in the top 10.', '2004-05-02 12:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(693528, 72316, 18868, '<td valign="top">The exposure is pretty far off -- the whole right side is over exposed.  In the future, there are a couple of things to try: if your camera has exposure lock, set the exposure on the right side, then re-frame the image to compose it the way you want.  Also, it looks like you were shooting into the sun.  You could stand on the opposite side of the big building (with the sun at your back). This would also have the effect of exaggeration -- making the big building look bigger and the small building look smaller.</td>', 'The exposure is pretty far off -- the whole right side is over exposed.  In the future, there are a couple of things to try: if your camera has exposure lock, set the exposure on the right side, then re-frame the image to compose it the way you want.  Also, it looks like you were shooting into the sun.  You could stand on the opposite side of the big building (with the sun at your back). This would also have the effect of exaggeration -- making the big building look bigger and the small building look smaller.', '2004-05-02 12:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(693531, 72631, 18868, '<td valign="top">Handsome image, and nice set-up.  It''s a little too contrasty for my taste.</td>', 'Handsome image, and nice set-up.  It''s a little too contrasty for my taste.', '2004-05-02 12:36:24.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(693533, 72667, 18868, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot -- should rank well.  I''m a little disapointed with the funny black triangle in the upper-right corner.  It seems that a step or two forward or backward (to include it as an element) would have been advisable.</td>', 'Really nice shot -- should rank well.  I''m a little disapointed with the funny black triangle in the upper-right corner.  It seems that a step or two forward or backward (to include it as an element) would have been advisable.', '2004-05-02 12:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(693540, 72578, 18868, '<td valign="top">It seems a little flat -- perhaps some more density in the mid-range (in photoshop/levels/ slide the middle -- gray -- slider to the right) would dramatically improve the shot.  Also, since the sky is almost totally blown out, re-shooting with less exposure would be appropriate as well.</td>', 'It seems a little flat -- perhaps some more density in the mid-range (in photoshop/levels/ slide the middle -- gray -- slider to the right) would dramatically improve the shot.  Also, since the sky is almost totally blown out, re-shooting with less exposure would be appropriate as well.', '2004-05-02 12:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(693543, 72771, 18868, '<td valign="top">Very clever set up.</td>', 'Very clever set up.', '2004-05-02 12:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(693545, 72045, 18868, '<td valign="top">Cool idea -- I''d love to know how you labeled the pills.</td>', 'Cool idea -- I''d love to know how you labeled the pills.', '2004-05-02 12:49:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(693551, 72813, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very Nice.</td>', 'Very Nice.', '2004-05-02 12:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(693552, 72811, 18868, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done!  I hope it scores as well as it deserves.  Is it me or are there dark hand-prints on the case of the G5?</td>', 'Very nicely done!  I hope it scores as well as it deserves.  Is it me or are there dark hand-prints on the case of the G5?', '2004-05-02 12:53:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(693553, 72516, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2004-05-02 12:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(693555, 72495, 18868, '<td valign="top">LOL... which is which?  The flash is too harsh -- perhaps bouncing the flash, or difusing the flash would be a big improvement.</td>', 'LOL... which is which?  The flash is too harsh -- perhaps bouncing the flash, or difusing the flash would be a big improvement.', '2004-05-02 12:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(693565, 72754, 18868, '<td valign="top">There''s been some chit-chat in the forums about titles, and yours proves (to me at least) that they have value.  It makes the picture a social commentary rather than "just another" macro shot.</td>', 'There''s been some chit-chat in the forums about titles, and yours proves (to me at least) that they have value.  It makes the picture a social commentary rather than "just another" macro shot.', '2004-05-02 13:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(693570, 72798, 18868, '<td valign="top">It''s a really nice studio shot, and technically, it''s really quite nice.  Unfortunately the subject is a little bland.</td>', 'It''s a really nice studio shot, and technically, it''s really quite nice.  Unfortunately the subject is a little bland.', '2004-05-02 13:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(693577, 72561, 18868, '<td valign="top">This could have been quite a nice shot -- pay some more attention to the details: the back-drop doesn''t cover the full frame; the lighting is reflecting badly on the tuning head; the image is soft.  If you have a tripod, use it, if not, stack up some books on a table and balance the camera on a towel. You have a good eye for composition, learning to control technique will improve your photography.</td>', 'This could have been quite a nice shot -- pay some more attention to the details: the back-drop doesn''t cover the full frame; the lighting is reflecting badly on the tuning head; the image is soft.  If you have a tripod, use it, if not, stack up some books on a table and balance the camera on a towel. You have a good eye for composition, learning to control technique will improve your photography.', '2004-05-02 13:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(693579, 72625, 10943, '<td valign="top">Niiice!  9</td>', 'Niiice!  9', '2004-05-02 13:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(693581, 72507, 10943, '<td valign="top">I like it!  Great constrast and colors.  7</td>', 'I like it!  Great constrast and colors.  7', '2004-05-02 13:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(693582, 72733, 10943, '<td valign="top">Why so small?  Other than the size, this is a nice photo from what I can see.</td>', 'Why so small?  Other than the size, this is a nice photo from what I can see.', '2004-05-02 13:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(693584, 72742, 18868, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  Such a bizarre thing, so surreal.  My only 10 so far.</td>', 'Awesome!  Such a bizarre thing, so surreal.  My only 10 so far.', '2004-05-02 13:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
