(694946, 72598, 12448, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, the overall feel of it just reminds me of home in Montana.  Can''t wait to get back there in August!  This is a great shot and the coloration is close to perfect for it.  The way the mountain disappears towards the top is awesome yet a bit fustrating at the same time, you know?  The trees in the front help add a bit of perspective to the shot but at the same time almost end up being distracting.  A very excellent shot overall, really makes you stop and look.  Started at an 8 but am moving to a 9, a touch more contrast would have garnished you a 10 from me.  Good Luck!</td>', 'I love this shot, the overall feel of it just reminds me of home in Montana.  Can''t wait to get back there in August!  This is a great shot and the coloration is close to perfect for it.  The way the mountain disappears towards the top is awesome yet a bit fustrating at the same time, you know?  The trees in the front help add a bit of perspective to the shot but at the same time almost end up being distracting.  A very excellent shot overall, really makes you stop and look.  Started at an 8 but am moving to a 9, a touch more contrast would have garnished you a 10 from me.  Good Luck!', '2004-05-03 09:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(694947, 71781, 12448, '<td valign="top">I like the way this shot really comes off the screen to me and the lack of proportion of the tools to the computer board is very well done.  A tighter crop on the top and bottom to take out the black space would really emphasize the lack of proportion to me though and a touch more sharpness.  An 8</td>', 'I like the way this shot really comes off the screen to me and the lack of proportion of the tools to the computer board is very well done.  A tighter crop on the top and bottom to take out the black space would really emphasize the lack of proportion to me though and a touch more sharpness.  An 8', '2004-05-03 09:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(694950, 72015, 17505, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but I find it very disturbing. I think it''s cropped too close, I want to know what the animal is. Interesting idea for meeting the challenge.</td>', 'Good idea, but I find it very disturbing. I think it''s cropped too close, I want to know what the animal is. Interesting idea for meeting the challenge.', '2004-05-03 09:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(694951, 72778, 12448, '<td valign="top">A good idea but without the title it really doesn''t make sense for the challenge overall.  Also the lettering on the water tower (it is a water tower, right?) also takes away from the illustion you were trying to create.  The duotone in the shot is also a bit dark and forbidding, I''m guessing you went with that because of the cloudy day.  I think black and white might have worked better with this shot and if you could have had a hand in there holding the base of the tower that would have really made this shot and fit the title better.    Contrast is also lacking to me, it seems flat and doesn''t really grab my attention.  Started at a 4 but am raising to a 5</td>', 'A good idea but without the title it really doesn''t make sense for the challenge overall.  Also the lettering on the water tower (it is a water tower, right?) also takes away from the illustion you were trying to create.  The duotone in the shot is also a bit dark and forbidding, I''m guessing you went with that because of the cloudy day.  I think black and white might have worked better with this shot and if you could have had a hand in there holding the base of the tower that would have really made this shot and fit the title better.    Contrast is also lacking to me, it seems flat and doesn''t really grab my attention.  Started at a 4 but am raising to a 5', '2004-05-03 10:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(694953, 72647, 17505, '<td valign="top">Good idea. Two problems...we can see your hand and the camera in teh door knob (which could possibly be cropped out) and the keyhole is out of focus. I think both the key and the hole should be in focus to tie them together. Still a good photo.</td>', 'Good idea. Two problems...we can see your hand and the camera in teh door knob (which could possibly be cropped out) and the keyhole is out of focus. I think both the key and the hole should be in focus to tie them together. Still a good photo.', '2004-05-03 10:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(694954, 72741, 12448, '<td valign="top">This would have been almost perfect for the abstract challenge.  Not really sure how it fits into this challenge.  The size of the shot really hurts, if you could bump the size up, that would really help.  Also the red cloth is wrinkled and pulls my eye away from from the main subject.  The subject looks more brown and white than black and white (I''m guessing you were going for black and white) and yes, my monitor is calibrated.  The overall composition and croppping of the shot is well done.  A 3</td>', 'This would have been almost perfect for the abstract challenge.  Not really sure how it fits into this challenge.  The size of the shot really hurts, if you could bump the size up, that would really help.  Also the red cloth is wrinkled and pulls my eye away from from the main subject.  The subject looks more brown and white than black and white (I''m guessing you were going for black and white) and yes, my monitor is calibrated.  The overall composition and croppping of the shot is well done.  A 3', '2004-05-03 10:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(694962, 72812, 12448, '<td valign="top">Took me a moment to find the small house.  The idea is there but a sign doesn''t really pull it off for me.  The lack of focus is also very hurtful to this shot.  Night shots are so hard, I know, I''ve been working on mine for the past week and it can be soooooooooooo fustrating, even with a tripod.  The glaring light really makes me want to look away.  It looks like this house might be on a slight hill, maybe you could go down the street and try to get a different angle with a couple of different houses to see if you could get a more forces proportion shot?  A 3</td>', 'Took me a moment to find the small house.  The idea is there but a sign doesn''t really pull it off for me.  The lack of focus is also very hurtful to this shot.  Night shots are so hard, I know, I''ve been working on mine for the past week and it can be soooooooooooo fustrating, even with a tripod.  The glaring light really makes me want to look away.  It looks like this house might be on a slight hill, maybe you could go down the street and try to get a different angle with a couple of different houses to see if you could get a more forces proportion shot?  A 3', '2004-05-03 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(694963, 72098, 17505, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped out a bit more of the sky. The focus is not as crisp as I would hope, but the photo overall does give a good idea of proportion.</td>', 'I would have cropped out a bit more of the sky. The focus is not as crisp as I would hope, but the photo overall does give a good idea of proportion.', '2004-05-03 10:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(694972, 71669, 12448, '<td valign="top">Yes, the church is bigger than the trees, as it should be and the sky is bigger than the church, as it should be and the shot is very well proportioned and well balanced.  But it seems a bit small and the post processing leaves me wanting.  Not sure if that is a natural color sky behind the church but from he color of the snow/street in the bottom of the shot, I''m guessing not.  The trees on the left seem almost surreal while the ones on the right seem very realistic.  The size of the shot seems rather small also and the lack of sharpness and contrast really throw me off here.  Perhaps if you were a bit closer, cut out the bottom part of the shot and put yourself down further to add a larger than life feel to the shot?  A 4 as is</td>', 'Yes, the church is bigger than the trees, as it should be and the sky is bigger than the church, as it should be and the shot is very well proportioned and well balanced.  But it seems a bit small and the post processing leaves me wanting.  Not sure if that is a natural color sky behind the church but from he color of the snow/street in the bottom of the shot, I''m guessing not.  The trees on the left seem almost surreal while the ones on the right seem very realistic.  The size of the shot seems rather small also and the lack of sharpness and contrast really throw me off here.  Perhaps if you were a bit closer, cut out the bottom part of the shot and put yourself down further to add a larger than life feel to the shot?  A 4 as is', '2004-05-03 10:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(694973, 72105, 17505, '<td valign="top">Simple and beautiful.</td>', 'Simple and beautiful.', '2004-05-03 10:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(694978, 72514, 17505, '<td valign="top">Cute. Good focus.</td>', 'Cute. Good focus.', '2004-05-03 10:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(694987, 72751, 17505, '<td valign="top">Nice! I love the little knees. Good choice of shoes and background. They''re simple and don''t detract from the overall photo. There seems to be quite a bit of digital noise on this photo, especially the legs.</td>', 'Nice! I love the little knees. Good choice of shoes and background. They''re simple and don''t detract from the overall photo. There seems to be quite a bit of digital noise on this photo, especially the legs.', '2004-05-03 10:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(694989, 72140, 17505, '<td valign="top">Nice use of black and white. good idea, well executed. A little sharper focus, especially on the larger shoe would have mede it perfect.</td>', 'Nice use of black and white. good idea, well executed. A little sharper focus, especially on the larger shoe would have mede it perfect.', '2004-05-03 10:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(694992, 72589, 17505, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Great lighting, props, colors and shadows.  When you have a photo this good all an obvious border can do is detract.</td>', 'Excellent! Great lighting, props, colors and shadows.  When you have a photo this good all an obvious border can do is detract.', '2004-05-03 10:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(694993, 72649, 17505, '<td valign="top">Nice use of silhouette and black &amp; white. The skiiers are not the main focus, and you''ve done a nice job telling us that. Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice use of silhouette and black & white. The skiiers are not the main focus, and you''ve done a nice job telling us that. Nice shot.', '2004-05-03 10:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(694996, 72519, 17505, '<td valign="top">Cute. I wish the gosling was in sharp focus as well. There seems to be a lot of noise at the top of the photo.</td>', 'Cute. I wish the gosling was in sharp focus as well. There seems to be a lot of noise at the top of the photo.', '2004-05-03 10:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(695000, 71757, 17505, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but it seems overexposed in the middle. Uniform lighting would have worked, and gotten a better overall photo.</td>', 'Good idea, but it seems overexposed in the middle. Uniform lighting would have worked, and gotten a better overall photo.', '2004-05-03 10:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(695003, 72646, 17505, '<td valign="top">Neat photo and good idea. I wish everything were more in focus though. I would love to see detail on the rock since that takes up so much of the frame.</td>', 'Neat photo and good idea. I wish everything were more in focus though. I would love to see detail on the rock since that takes up so much of the frame.', '2004-05-03 10:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(695008, 71943, 17505, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge. I like it, nice job. I just wish I could see the whole horse, especially the tail.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge. I like it, nice job. I just wish I could see the whole horse, especially the tail.', '2004-05-03 10:39:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(695010, 72631, 17505, '<td valign="top">Simple idea, interesting and unique execution. Good colors and I love that the little container is all bubbly.</td>', 'Simple idea, interesting and unique execution. Good colors and I love that the little container is all bubbly.', '2004-05-03 10:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(695016, 72795, 17505, '<td valign="top">Great idea and good models. I wish the background were out of focus, it''s a little distracting. Overall, a very good shot.</td>', 'Great idea and good models. I wish the background were out of focus, it''s a little distracting. Overall, a very good shot.', '2004-05-03 10:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(695030, 72721, 17505, '<td valign="top">Nice lines, cute idea. <br/>I would like to see a bit more of the wrists. It seems a little claustrophobic to me.</td>', 'Nice lines, cute idea. I would like to see a bit more of the wrists. It seems a little claustrophobic to me.', '2004-05-03 10:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(695037, 72556, 17505, '<td valign="top">Good idea. I wonder what it would hale looked like in portrait instead of landscape.  A little more depth of field would have made this a little stronger, too. Nice shot.</td>', 'Good idea. I wonder what it would hale looked like in portrait instead of landscape.  A little more depth of field would have made this a little stronger, too. Nice shot.', '2004-05-03 11:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(695045, 72667, 17505, '<td valign="top">Interesting on many levels. Good social commentary, nice lines, good colors. I''d be very intereded in knowing if you posed this, since his jacket and shirt match the reds and blues around him. Very good.</td>', 'Interesting on many levels. Good social commentary, nice lines, good colors. I''d be very intereded in knowing if you posed this, since his jacket and shirt match the reds and blues around him. Very good.', '2004-05-03 11:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(695046, 72465, 17505, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Great colors.</td>', 'Beautiful. Great colors.', '2004-05-03 11:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(695061, 72565, 17505, '<td valign="top">Yes!<br/>Good use of muted colors and silhouettes.</td>', 'Yes!Good use of muted colors and silhouettes.', '2004-05-03 11:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(695082, 71810, 17505, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle, but a photo this out of focus will not get many votes.</td>', 'Interesting angle, but a photo this out of focus will not get many votes.', '2004-05-03 11:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(695086, 72397, 17505, '<td valign="top">I see where you were going with this, but you have no focus on either of the main objects. You need to set your camera to a higher f stop in order to get more of your shot in focus.</td>', 'I see where you were going with this, but you have no focus on either of the main objects. You need to set your camera to a higher f stop in order to get more of your shot in focus.', '2004-05-03 11:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(695095, 72502, 17505, '<td valign="top">Your background is in focus, but your main subject is not.</td>', 'Your background is in focus, but your main subject is not.', '2004-05-03 11:38:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(695098, 72739, 17505, '<td valign="top">The colors in this photo are extremely distorted. Also, I would not have cut the bottom of the bottles off, we should be able to see teh whole object to make it feel complete.</td>', 'The colors in this photo are extremely distorted. Also, I would not have cut the bottom of the bottles off, we should be able to see teh whole object to make it feel complete.', '2004-05-03 11:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(695102, 72658, 17505, '<td valign="top">Way out of focus</td>', 'Way out of focus', '2004-05-03 11:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(695105, 72508, 17505, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, nice angle, good focus.</td>', 'Interesting idea, nice angle, good focus.', '2004-05-03 11:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
