(695697, 71835, 2883, '<td valign="top">For me, this doesn''t really convey proportion very well. It looks like an overly softened Kerry Wood action figure (the pitcher looks plasticized) with a baseball held up in front of the camera. Overall, it''s a nice photo, but I think having the baseball out of focus and the pitcher in focus would have been better. I do like the composition, though.</td>', 'For me, this doesn''t really convey proportion very well. It looks like an overly softened Kerry Wood action figure (the pitcher looks plasticized) with a baseball held up in front of the camera. Overall, it''s a nice photo, but I think having the baseball out of focus and the pitcher in focus would have been better. I do like the composition, though.', '2004-05-03 17:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
