(696890, 72763, 17530, '<td valign="top">Well taken but dreadfully dreadfully dull<br/> <br/>- I should add:<br/>Since the purpose of this site is about improving one''s<br/>technical ability, this is a first rate shot.<br/>I could do with a few lessons in lighting and exposure myself.<br/>Quite why you''ve gone for a still life of some clips is beyond<br/>me, though. I always find shots like this hard to vote on - it<br/>leaves me cold, so I want to give it a 3, but I can''t fault it<br/>technically so I should give it at least a 5? I''ll go 4</td>', 'Well taken but dreadfully dreadfully dull - I should add:Since the purpose of this site is about improving one''stechnical ability, this is a first rate shot.I could do with a few lessons in lighting and exposure myself.Quite why you''ve gone for a still life of some clips is beyondme, though. I always find shots like this hard to vote on - itleaves me cold, so I want to give it a 3, but I can''t fault ittechnically so I should give it at least a 5? I''ll go 4', '2004-05-04 09:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
