(696925, 71973, 12448, '<td valign="top">Very good idea but the shot leave me wanting more.  The composition of the shot seems off, lack of focus and the cropping also seems off to me.  The way the shadow got cut off on the left.  I do like the fact that I can''t see the camera shadow, a lot of people forget about that and it usually ruins the shot for me.  A 3</td>', 'Very good idea but the shot leave me wanting more.  The composition of the shot seems off, lack of focus and the cropping also seems off to me.  The way the shadow got cut off on the left.  I do like the fact that I can''t see the camera shadow, a lot of people forget about that and it usually ruins the shot for me.  A 3', '2004-05-04 10:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
