(697048, 72795, 15295, '<td valign="top">Cute picture, but the shadows on the wall are distracting.  Other than that I think this is a great picture and I like the contrast in colors in both of the arms.  6</td>', 'Cute picture, but the shadows on the wall are distracting.  Other than that I think this is a great picture and I like the contrast in colors in both of the arms.  6', '2004-05-04 12:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(697054, 72593, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a pleasing arrangement of these baskets. However, placed dead center like this with a horizontal format  the composition suffers. Consider cropping it to exclude most of the grassy background.</td>', 'This is a pleasing arrangement of these baskets. However, placed dead center like this with a horizontal format  the composition suffers. Consider cropping it to exclude most of the grassy background.', '2004-05-04 12:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(697060, 72535, 20650, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo Love the angle you took it at the way it all reflects in the water</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo Love the angle you took it at the way it all reflects in the water', '2004-05-04 12:57:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(697062, 72748, 20650, '<td valign="top">This is very creative, I like what you have done here</td>', 'This is very creative, I like what you have done here', '2004-05-04 12:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(697063, 71771, 7322, '<td valign="top">We''ve made a couple of road trips to Georgia and the site of this tower always makes me smile. Using the trees as a framing device makes a funny statement about proportion. Good job!</td>', 'We''ve made a couple of road trips to Georgia and the site of this tower always makes me smile. Using the trees as a framing device makes a funny statement about proportion. Good job!', '2004-05-04 12:59:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(697067, 72673, 20650, '<td valign="top">I like the way you took this photo you can see everything and I love how the cloud reflect in the windows.</td>', 'I like the way you took this photo you can see everything and I love how the cloud reflect in the windows.', '2004-05-04 13:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(697069, 71928, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice candid of this young scientist. The exposure and color is good. The framing is tight and intimate. I don''t really think it says anything about proportion without the massive hint from your title. I just want you to know I''m scoring low because of that. Otherwise, I like the photo.</td>', 'This is a nice candid of this young scientist. The exposure and color is good. The framing is tight and intimate. I don''t really think it says anything about proportion without the massive hint from your title. I just want you to know I''m scoring low because of that. Otherwise, I like the photo.', '2004-05-04 13:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(697085, 71689, 7322, '<td valign="top">I suggest cropping so that the girl is off-center and you''ve eliminated about half the expanse of water. You''ll still have a strong statement but more focus will be on the toddler.</td>', 'I suggest cropping so that the girl is off-center and you''ve eliminated about half the expanse of water. You''ll still have a strong statement but more focus will be on the toddler.', '2004-05-04 13:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(697108, 72548, 21029, '<td valign="top">Excellent Work</td>', 'Excellent Work', '2004-05-04 13:37:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(697109, 72341, 17790, '<td valign="top">first photo that captures my interest and successfully interprets proportion!</td>', 'first photo that captures my interest and successfully interprets proportion!', '2004-05-04 13:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(697119, 72282, 15920, '<td valign="top">Mine too. <br/> <br/>If that is not your Camaro, you did as well as you could have.  If it is your Camaro, taking thi shot at home with a less busy background would have made it a stronger image.  Another option might be to play hard with the DOF and blur out some of the distractions, but that is a tenuous suggestion without actually knowing more about the location.</td>', 'Mine too.  If that is not your Camaro, you did as well as you could have.  If it is your Camaro, taking thi shot at home with a less busy background would have made it a stronger image.  Another option might be to play hard with the DOF and blur out some of the distractions, but that is a tenuous suggestion without actually knowing more about the location.', '2004-05-04 13:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(697123, 72464, 15920, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice.  I thought the "skinny" Budha was unknown outside China (and even there, for only a short period of a couple hundred years.)  Given what you had to work with (a half painted statue), I think this composition is pretty strong.  I might have cropped out the brick though.</td>', 'Interesting choice.  I thought the "skinny" Budha was unknown outside China (and even there, for only a short period of a couple hundred years.)  Given what you had to work with (a half painted statue), I think this composition is pretty strong.  I might have cropped out the brick though.', '2004-05-04 14:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(697124, 72478, 20375, '<td valign="top">Good Angle! Well done.</td>', 'Good Angle! Well done.', '2004-05-04 14:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(697141, 72737, 18838, '<td valign="top">the idea is pretty funny, but the picture does seem a bit overexposed (maybe you wanted it like this) ... i would have liked a bit more greyscale on the people (the girls face almost disappears in the background, so do the guys shoulders) ... and the cardboard blacker ... 7</td>', 'the idea is pretty funny, but the picture does seem a bit overexposed (maybe you wanted it like this) ... i would have liked a bit more greyscale on the people (the girls face almost disappears in the background, so do the guys shoulders) ... and the cardboard blacker ... 7', '2004-05-04 14:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(697144, 72104, 18838, '<td valign="top">hmmm ... good idea, but kind of boring execution</td>', 'hmmm ... good idea, but kind of boring execution', '2004-05-04 14:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(697194, 72258, 19780, '<td valign="top">wonderful contrasts of the white of the house with the white of the cows. I wish it was bigger so I could really see the details.</td>', 'wonderful contrasts of the white of the house with the white of the cows. I wish it was bigger so I could really see the details.', '2004-05-04 15:10:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(697218, 72046, 17505, '<td valign="top">Interesting. I love the little red jacket and the contrast between black and white in the hills.</td>', 'Interesting. I love the little red jacket and the contrast between black and white in the hills.', '2004-05-04 15:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(697236, 71716, 17505, '<td valign="top">This photo is extremely out of focus. <br/>You should use manual focus if at all possible in low light.<br/>If you don''t have manual then you need more light and a tripod.<br/>Good idea though.</td>', 'This photo is extremely out of focus. You should use manual focus if at all possible in low light.If you don''t have manual then you need more light and a tripod.Good idea though.', '2004-05-04 15:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(697278, 72565, 20124, '<td valign="top">An interesting angle on the proportion theme.</td>', 'An interesting angle on the proportion theme.', '2004-05-04 15:56:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(697281, 72735, 20124, '<td valign="top">Funny...really fits the theme well.  A 9</td>', 'Funny...really fits the theme well.  A 9', '2004-05-04 15:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(697282, 72679, 16106, '<td valign="top">Nice shot well exposed and set up, but the composition is a bit centered, and the big wide strong border brings that slight flaw firmly to the fore.</td>', 'Nice shot well exposed and set up, but the composition is a bit centered, and the big wide strong border brings that slight flaw firmly to the fore.', '2004-05-04 15:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(697285, 72800, 16106, '<td valign="top">beautifull shot but was it ment to be entered in abstract. Will suffer in scoring because I see no relation between image and challenge.</td>', 'beautifull shot but was it ment to be entered in abstract. Will suffer in scoring because I see no relation between image and challenge.', '2004-05-04 16:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(697293, 71912, 16106, '<td valign="top">A classic idea well executed, technically fine and well composed.</td>', 'A classic idea well executed, technically fine and well composed.', '2004-05-04 16:04:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(697298, 72535, 16106, '<td valign="top">great image but I wish it was bigger so I could see it better. what I can see is strong, but it is half the size of the better images.</td>', 'great image but I wish it was bigger so I could see it better. what I can see is strong, but it is half the size of the better images.', '2004-05-04 16:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
