(697312, 72631, 16106, '<td valign="top">I wish the bottom of the pitcher was in the photo, It would make a strong composition stronger. There is alot of white in the upper left, either re shoot or crop to match more closely.</td>', 'I wish the bottom of the pitcher was in the photo, It would make a strong composition stronger. There is alot of white in the upper left, either re shoot or crop to match more closely.', '2004-05-04 16:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
