(697335, 72779, 16106, '<td valign="top">lol . The title ( which I keep meaning to remember to ignore) makes this pretty good shot, very good.</td>', 'lol . The title ( which I keep meaning to remember to ignore) makes this pretty good shot, very good.', '2004-05-04 16:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
