(697405, 71501, 21202, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle.  Background makes good contrast fro emphasizing lashes.  I hate those long white eyebrow hairs as you get older.</td>', 'Interesting angle.  Background makes good contrast fro emphasizing lashes.  I hate those long white eyebrow hairs as you get older.', '2004-05-04 17:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
