(697419, 72478, 21202, '<td valign="top">Great reflection.  Great color on reflecting building.  Love the interior lights. Could have cropped of most of left building and lower part of photo.</td>', 'Great reflection.  Great color on reflecting building.  Love the interior lights. Could have cropped of most of left building and lower part of photo.', '2004-05-04 17:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(697420, 72097, 16478, '<td valign="top">If only there was something small in shot, like a bird sitting on the tusk, you would have a fantastic shot. As it is I''m afraid it doesn''t fit the challenge</td>', 'If only there was something small in shot, like a bird sitting on the tusk, you would have a fantastic shot. As it is I''m afraid it doesn''t fit the challenge', '2004-05-04 17:30:26.000000', NULL, 1),
