(698265, 72508, 12448, '<td valign="top">Congrats on third place!  I never got back to this one during the challenge, it was one of my favs and am glad to see it did so well.  The nose on the left did throw me off at first though, I knew it would be discolored but I did''nt expect it to lose all it''s color through the window.  Excellent capture either way and congrats again!<br/> <br/>Deannda</td>', 'Congrats on third place!  I never got back to this one during the challenge, it was one of my favs and am glad to see it did so well.  The nose on the left did throw me off at first though, I knew it would be discolored but I did''nt expect it to lose all it''s color through the window.  Excellent capture either way and congrats again! Deannda', '2004-05-05 01:48:37.000000', NULL, 0),
