(698714, 72770, 18349, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your comments and votes.  I am kind of tickled that it nearly made the top 10!  Dang the Texas weather; if it had been sunny and nice it might have made it higher than 11.<br/> <br/>BTW:  I didn''t try to brighten up the greyness because I didn''t want to screw up ANYTHING that could possibly be against the challenge rules...I guess I am kind of paranoid due to so much hullaballoo regarding rules, dates, editing, and everything else.  I''ll work on it and try to post an edited version to my portfolio soon.  Thanks again!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-05-05 14:17:07.</i></td>', 'Thanks for all your comments and votes.  I am kind of tickled that it nearly made the top 10!  Dang the Texas weather; if it had been sunny and nice it might have made it higher than 11. BTW:  I didn''t try to brighten up the greyness because I didn''t want to screw up ANYTHING that could possibly be against the challenge rules...I guess I am kind of paranoid due to so much hullaballoo regarding rules, dates, editing, and everything else.  I''ll work on it and try to post an edited version to my portfolio soon.  Thanks again!!', '2004-05-05 05:08:16.000000', '2004-05-05 15:17:07.000000', 0),
